<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- LAG Rangi Translation Project, Dodoma, Tanzania</book>
  <para style="h">Maáriki</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant: John Macaulay</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maáriki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Masáare Maaja ja ˆvyeene yaandɨkwa nɨ Maáriki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu Kirisitʉ</para>
  <para style="mt2">ja ˆvyeene yaandɨkwa nɨ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maáriki</para>
  <para style="imt">Mʉlongooryo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɨtáabu ɨkɨ, chaandɨkwa nɨ Yooháani Maáriki ˆiituubáa na vala Peéteri, Paúli na Barinába mpɨɨndɨ ˆvavariyʉláa Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu Kirisitʉ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-13">Mɨrɨmo ya Vatumwi 13:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:36-41">15:36-41</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:13">1 Peéteri 5:13</ref></char>). Masáare aya, ˆvyeene vamanyi vaséaa, yaandɨkwa kati ya myaaka ya 60-65 keende Kirisitʉ ˆavyaalwa. Viintʉ ˆvyoónekanaa, Maáriki noo wa ncholo ˆaandɨka Masáare Maaja.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɨɨntʉ ˆchabweeyya Maáriki aandɨke masáare aya, nɨ kʉvaheera mʉtɨma vaantʉ ˆvamuruma Yéesu ˆveene vaturikiriwáa maatʉkʉ vii nɨ Kaisáari Néero, mʉtemi wa ɨsɨ ya Rúumi. Maáriki asaakáa vaantʉ ˆvamuruma Yéesu vɨɨme neeja baa koonɨ nɨ kuturikiriwa fʉʉrʉ vakwye ja Kirisitʉ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maáriki alumiriryalumiriirya ˆvyeene Yéesu akwaatwa, akaheewa irya ro kʉʉlawa nɨ Vayahúudi na Varúumi baa ʉvɨ tʉkʉ, akaturikiriwa, akaningʼiniwa mʉsaláabii fʉʉrʉ akakwya, na sikʉ ya katatʉ akafʉfʉka (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 14:43-16:20">14:43–16:20</ref></char>). Kei, alumirirya Kirisitʉ nɨ Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 3:11">3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:7">5:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:39">15:39</ref></char>). Noo ˆchooreka aanda na masáare aya, “Ɨhɨ noo ncholo ya Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu Kirisitʉ, Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1">1:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Maáriki alumirirya myuujíisa ˆɨrɨ foo ˆmyeene Yéesu atʉmamáa, koonekya Yéesu nɨ Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ kɨmaarɨ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:35-5:43">4:35–5:43</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-56">6:30-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:31-9:32">7:31–9:32</ref></char>). Kei, alumirirya mwiikalo wa Yéesu, ˆvyeene iitoola sa alamurirye vaantʉ vaachwe, “Sa baa Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ, sɨ ʉʉja jo tʉmamɨrwa tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, ʉʉja sa jɨ avatʉmamɨre vaantʉ, kei atoole nkaasʉ yaachwe kʉva ununuuli sa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 10:45">10:45</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">ˆVyeene Kɨtáabu ɨkɨ Chagavwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Ncholo ya Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mʉrɨmo wa Yéesu ʉko Galiláaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-9:50">1:14–9:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yéesu yootamanya na Yerusaléemu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10:1-52</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Júma Yéesu ˆajáa Yerusaléemu</para>
  <para style="io2">Ʉvariyuli wa Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu Yerusaléemu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-13:37">11:1–13:37</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Kuningʼiniwa kwa Yéesu mʉsaláabii na inkwya yaachwe <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 14:1-15:47">14:1–15:47</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kʉfʉfʉka na koonekana kwa Yéesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:1-20">16:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji Yoomwiimirya Njɨra Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matáayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lʉ́ka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yooháani 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Ɨhɨ noo ncholo ya <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> ya <char style="w">Yéesu</char> <char style="w">Kirisitʉ</char>, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Ja ˆvyeene Ijʉva alʉʉsa kɨtáabwii cha Isáaya, <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> waachwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Laanga, mʉtʉma ndɨrɨ <char style="w" lemma="Vatumwi">mutumwi</char> waanɨ akʉlongorɨre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">yeeye kʉtengenesherya arɨ njɨra yaako.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Maláaki 3:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Mʉʉntʉ yookaanɨrɨra vikʉlʉkʉʉlʉ ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Imyi neeja njɨra sa <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">wololi njɨra ˆngʼeene arɨ tweera.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isáaya 40:3</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Masáare aya yakiimana, Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji afʉmɨra ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii, yoovariyʉla <char style="w" lemma="Batisa">ʉbatíiso</char> wa vaantʉ <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">kʉvalandʉka</char> fuma uvii waavo, sa Mʉlʉʉngʉ asee, ʉvɨ waavo wasírire. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Vaantʉ fuma ɨsɨ yoosi ya <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char>, na mavaru yoosi ya Yerusaléemu, vadomáa noo mʉteerera. Yeeye avabatisáa aho luujii lwa Yorodáani, kʉnʉ voolʉʉsa ʉvɨ waavo. <verse eid="MRK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Yooháani iivɨkɨráa ɨngo ya mabaáhɨra ya ngamɨ́a na lʉkova iimʉ́tɨɨre.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Vatemi 1:8</ref>.</char></note> Kɨɨntʉ ˆarijáa nɨ nkʉʉmbɨ na hʉʉkɨ wa isekii. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Na avariyʉláa ɨndoosea, “Amwaarɨ ˆyookʉʉja nyuma yaanɨ ˆarɨ na ngururu kʉlookya nɨɨnɨ, nɨɨnɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ daha baa tʉmama mʉrɨmo wa mʉtʉ́mwa wo reherya nkova ja mirunkumo yaachwe tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Nɨɨnɨ noobatisa na maaji, maa kaa, yeeye vabatisa arɨ na <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char>.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoobatisiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matáayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lʉ́ka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Sikʉ jira, Yéesu akʉʉja fuma Nasaréeti múuji wa <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>, maa akabatisiwa nɨ Yooháani luujii lwa Yorodáani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>ˆAkafume vii hara luujii, akoona kurumu kookwaatʉka dwee, na Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja yookiima mweeri yaachwe ja nkúnde.<figure style="fig" alt="Spirit descending like a dove" file="WA03810b.tif" size="col" copy="United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya" ref="1:10">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja yookiima ja nkúnde</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Maa sawúti ɨkafuma kurumwii, yoosea, “Weewe ʉrɨ Mwaana waanɨ ˆnakweenda, neeriwa mʉtɨma nɨ weewe mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooyerwa nɨ Irimʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matáayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Lʉ́ka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Ayo ˆyakalooke vii, Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja akamʉtwaala fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Akiikala ʉko ibaláángwii sikʉ makumi yanɨ (40) yooyerwa nɨ <char style="w">Irimʉ</char>, ʉko iikaláa na maka ja isaka, <char style="w">mirimʉ miija</char> noyo yamʉtʉmamɨráa.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookaanda Variyʉla Masáare Maaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Sikʉ ˆjikalooke, Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji akakwaatwa, maa akavɨɨkwa mʉnyololwii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maáriki 6:14-29</ref>.</char></note> Sikʉ ijo, Yéesu akadoma na Galiláaya, ɨndoovariyʉla Masáare Maaja ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>yoosea, “Mpɨɨndɨ jafíkire, <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> waséngerɨɨre. Valanduki fuma uvii waanyu na murume Masáare Maaja.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovaanɨrɨra Vapooji va Ncholo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matáayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lʉ́ka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, mpɨɨndɨ ˆalookáa na mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva ra Galiláaya, akamoona Simóoni na mwaanaavo Anderéa, voowʉmɨra lwaavu na luujii, sa voovo nɨ vavúuvi vajáa. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Aho, Yéesu akavasea, “Ntuubi, na vabweeyya ndɨrɨ mʉve vavúuvi va vaantʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Hahara, vakareka njwaavu jaavo, vakamutuuba.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>ˆAkadome na mbere kiduudi, akavoona vala Yaakúupu na Yooháani vala sha Sebedáayo, vajáa mashúwii voolʉkanʼya njwaavu jaavo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>ˆAkavoone vii, maa akavaanɨrɨra. Novo vakamutuuba, vakamʉreka taáta waavo na vara vavúuvi vɨɨngɨ ˆvamʉtʉmamɨráa.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookibirya Murimʉ Mʉvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Lʉ́ka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Kufuma aho, vakadoma fʉʉrʉ múujii wa Kaperenáumu. Sikʉ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char> Yéesu akɨɨngɨra na <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">sinagóogii</char>, maa akaanda variyʉla Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Vaantʉ vakahwaalariwa nɨ ʉvariyuli waachwe, sa yeeye sɨ avariyʉláa ja <char style="w" lemma="Vakiindya va Miiro">vakiindya vaavo va Miiro</char> tʉkʉ, kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, yeeye akiindyáa ja mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ na wiimiriri.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Hara sinagóogii yaavo, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆajáa na <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ mɨvɨ">murimʉ mʉvɨ</char>, akatʉlatʉʉla isóso <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>yoosea, “Weewe Yéesu wa Nasaréeti, che woosaaka kʉrɨ suusu? Wuújire tʉmala wʉʉ? Nakʉmányire ʉrɨ ani weewe! Weewe ʉrɨ Mʉʉja wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yéesu akʉʉdalavya ʉra murimʉ mʉvɨ yoosea, “Kirinya sawu! Fuma kʉrɨ ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Hahara, ʉra murimʉ mʉvɨ ʉkamusukasuka ʉra mʉʉntʉ na ngururu, kʉnʉ wootʉlatʉʉla isóso, maa ʉkafuma.<verse eid="MRK 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Hara, vaantʉ voosi vakatʉlʉvala, maa vakaanda kiisea, “Ɨkɨ nɨ che? Nɨ ukiindya mufya, kei ˆʉrɨ na wiimiriri! Yoolairirya baa mirimʉ mɨvɨ, noyo yoomʉteerera!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Masáare aya, yakeenera chaangʉ ɨsɨ yoosi ya Galiláaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉkwɨ wa Simóoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matáayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lʉ́ka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Yéesu, Yaakúupu, Yooháani, Simóoni na Anderéa vakafuma hara sinagóogii, vakadoma fʉʉrʉ kaayii kwaala Simóoni na Anderéa. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>ˆVakafike, vakamʉshaana mʉkwɨ wa Simóoni ajáa nchiirii aváirwe nɨ ndwáala. Hahara, vakamuwyɨɨra Yéesu masáare yaachwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Akaseesa na hara kʉʉntʉ ˆajáa alɨ́ɨre, akamʉkwaata mʉkono ʉra maáma, maa akamwiinʉla, hahara akahola, maa akaanda vatʉmamɨra.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovahorya Vaantʉ ˆVarɨ Foo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Niiwʉlo mwaasʉ ˆʉkakʉtʉmɨre, Sabáato ɨkalooka. Vaantʉ vakaanda mʉretera valwɨ́ɨrɨ voosi, na vaantʉ ˆvarɨ na mirimʉ mɨvɨ. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Aho, vaantʉ voosi va ʉra múuji vakiisaanka mbere ya kaaya. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Hara, maa Yéesu akava yoovahorya vaantʉ voosi ˆvajáa na ndwáala ˆjiísimiresimire, baa kei iikibiryáa mirimʉ mɨvɨ ˆɨrɨ foo. Maa kaa, sɨ ɨɨrekeráa ɨyo mirimʉ mɨvɨ ɨlʉʉsɨke tʉkʉ, sa ɨjáa yamʉmányire yeeye nɨ ani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovariyʉla Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho Galiláaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Lʉ́ka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Lomʉtóondo yaachwe baa sɨ kʉna mwaa, Yéesu akadoma na kijiraawii, kʉra akamʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simóoni na viivaachwe vakamʉloonda. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>ˆVakamoone, vakamʉsea, “Kɨra mʉʉntʉ yookʉsaakɨra.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Hendi na haantʉ hɨɨngɨ, míijii yɨɨngɨ ˆɨrɨ mʉkaaya, nkavariyʉle baa ʉko, sa nʉʉja, sa mʉrɨmo ʉwo.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Jeyyo, akarɨɨngɨrɨra ɨsɨ yoosi ya Galiláaya, kʉnʉ yoovariyʉla Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho masinagóogii, na avahoryáa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ na mirimʉ mɨvɨ.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ ˆArɨ na Ʉlóónda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matáayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lʉ́ka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ, ˆarɨ na ndwáala ya <char style="w">ʉlóónda</char>. Akʉʉja kʉrɨ Yéesu, akachwaama, akiiloombererya yoosea, “Koonɨ woosaaka, ifaanaa ʉkaanjirʉla ndwáala yaanɨ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yéesu akamoonera mbavariri, akiinʉla mʉkono waachwe, akamʉsaasya, maa akamʉsea, “Noosaaka, ujirʉlwe!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Hahara, akajirʉlwa na akahola ɨra ndwáala yaachwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Yéesu akamʉrekera adome, maa kaa, akamʉkaanʼya yoomʉsea, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>“Karɨ umuwyɨ́ɨraa mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi isáare ɨrɨ tʉkʉ, tamanya ukiiyonekye kwa <char style="w" lemma="Veeneɨsɨ">mweeneɨsɨ</char> wa Ijʉva, ʉtoole na <char style="w">mpóryo</char> yo jirʉlwa, ja ˆvyeene <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> alairirya, sa vataange kɨmaarɨ ʉhórire.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Valáawi 14:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:8">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 24:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Kɨrɨ vyoobweeyya jeyyo, ʉra mʉʉntʉ akadoma, akaanda kaarya yara masáare kɨra haantʉ. Sa jeyyo, Yéesu sɨ adaha kɨɨngɨra na múujii ko kiiyonekya tʉkʉ, nɨ iikaláa kijiraawii vii. Maa kaa, baa neembe iivisáa, vaantʉ vamutuubáa fuma kɨra haantʉ.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ ˆAakwya Iyandiyandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-18">Matáayo 9:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lʉ́ka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Sikʉ ˆjikaseese, akahɨndʉka na Kaperenáumu, vaantʉ vakateera ahíndukire na kaayii. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ikiijiinga, ɨkasoveka baa nkalo mʉryaangwii. Ne akava yoovavariyʉrɨra Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho.<verse eid="MRK 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆaakwya iyandiyandi, akareetwa kʉrɨ <char style="w">Yéesu</char> iínwɨɨrwe nɨ vaantʉ vanɨ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Sa ɨra mpuka nkʉʉlʉ, vara vaantʉ vakasiindwa kʉmʉlookya ʉra mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ fʉʉrʉ kʉrɨ Yéesu. ˆVakoone jeyyo, vakaambʉka nɨ ikekeerii, vakabontola ikekeera hara kʉʉntʉ Yéesu ˆajáa, vakamukiimirya ʉra mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ na ndɨrɨ yaachwe.<figure style="fig" alt="Man lowered through the house" file="WA03824b.tif" size="col" copy="United Bible Societies,1989, Nairobi Kenya" ref="2:4">Mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ yookiimiriwa na kʉrɨ Yéesu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yéesu ˆakoone kuruma kwaavo, akamʉsea ʉra mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ, “Mwaana waanɨ, ʉvɨ waako wasírire.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Aho nyuumbii, kwajáa kwatɨɨte <char style="w" lemma="Vakiindya va Miiro">vakiindya vamwɨ va Miiro</char> vajáa viíkyɨɨre, vakaanda kiiririkana mitimii yaavo voosea, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Joolɨ arɨ lʉʉsa jei? <char style="w" lemma="Hɨɨntɨka">Yoomʉhɨɨntɨkɨra</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ! Sɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ yeemweene noo ˆadáhaa sea ʉvɨ wasírire tʉkʉ wʉʉ?” <verse eid="MRK 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Hahara, Yéesu akataanga miiririkano yaavo, maa akavasea, “Nɨ sa che mookiiririkana ayo mitimii yaanyu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Nɨ kɨrɨkwɨ noo chaangʉ kʉlookya myeewe, kʉmʉsea ʉhʉ mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ, ‘Ʉvɨ waako wasírire,’ bakʉ kʉmʉsea, ‘Inʉka, ʉtoole ndɨrɨ yaako ʉlooke’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Haaha noosaaka mʉtaange, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> atɨɨte wiimiriri wo sea vaantʉ, ‘Ʉvɨ waavo wasírire,’ aha weerwii.” Aho, akamʉsea ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆaakwya iyandiyandi, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Nookʉsea, inʉka, toola ndɨrɨ yaako, ʉdome na kaayii kwaako.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Hahara, maa akatoola ndɨrɨ yaachwe akafuma na weerwii, baa vara vaantʉ voosi ntɨ ˆvoomʉlaanga. Maa vakatʉlʉvala, vakamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ voosea, “Isáare ja ɨrɨ, sɨ tʉnoona vii kaa tʉkʉ!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Ʉʉja jo Kaanɨrɨra Vavɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matáayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lʉ́ka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Hara, maa Yéesu akadoma kei na mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva ra <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. Mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ ɨkamutuuba, maa akaanda kʉvavariyʉrɨra Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho.<verse eid="MRK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆawololáa mawʉlʉ, akamoona Láawi mwaana wa Alʉfáayo iíkyɨɨre kɨvaandii cho rɨhɨra kóodi, yoosaankanʼya kóodi. Akamʉsea, “Ntuuba!” Ne Láawi akiinʉka, akamutuuba Yéesu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe ˆvarijáa chákurya kaayii kwa Láawi, <char style="w">vasaankanʼyi kóodi</char> na vaduwalo ˆvarɨ foo varijáa novo. Sa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo, vamutuubáa. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Vakiindya vamwɨ va <char style="w">Miiro</char> ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ na <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> vajáa vamwaarɨ. ˆVakamoone Yéesu yoorya hamwɨ na vaduwalo na vasaankanʼyi kóodi, vakavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Sa che yoorya chákurya hamwɨ na maduwalo na masaankanʼyi kóodi?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yéesu ˆakayateere ayo masáare, maa akavasea, “Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ nkaasʉ sɨ vasáakaa mwaanga tʉkʉ, maa kaa, valwɨ́ɨrɨ noo vasáakaa mwaanga. Sɨ nʉʉja joo kaanɨrɨra vaantʉ ˆviiyónaa vawoloki tʉkʉ, nʉʉja joo kaanɨrɨra vavɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookuuriwa Kwiirekya Kurya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matáayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lʉ́ka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Haaha, vapooji va Yooháani na va Mafarisáayo viirekyáa kurya. Maa vaantʉ vakʉʉja joo muurya Yéesu vakamʉsea, “Amwɨ vapooji va Yooháani na va Mafarisáayo viirékyaa kurya. Sa che vapooji vaako sɨ viirékyaa kurya?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yéesu akavasea, “De vyadáhɨkaa vaantʉ ˆvaláarikirwe nɨ mweenengovi, na mweenengovi ntɨ ˆarɨ novo kwiirekya kurya wʉʉ? Sɨ varɨ kwiirekya kurya tʉkʉ, mpɨɨndɨ joosi varɨ na mweenengovi. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Maa kaa, luu fika jiri mpɨɨndɨ mweenengovi ˆakasʉmwɨɨrwe fuma kwaavo, aho noo luu vakiirekiirye kurya.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>Kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆadáhɨraa kɨráka kifya isaámwii tʉkʉ. Koonɨ abwéeyyiirye jeyyo, ɨkyo kɨráka moola kɨrɨ ɨro isaámʉ na ɨyo ɨngo kwaatʉka ɨrɨ kʉlookya lo ncholo. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Baa kei, kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆavɨ́kɨraa <char style="w">diváai</char> ifya viríibii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">viríibii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Viríiba nɨ saama ˆjavɨ́kɨraa diváai. Jaténgeneshiwaa na ndɨrɨ.</char></note> vya kalɨ tʉkʉ. Koonɨ abwéeyyiirye jeyyo, ɨyo diváai ifya, pʉsʉla ɨrɨ ivyo viríiba, na diváai kɨɨtɨka ɨrɨ na mweenediváai sova arɨ diváai na viríiba. Diváai ifya nɨ viríibii vifya ɨvɨ́kɨrwaa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu nɨ Mweeneevyo wa Sabáato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-18">Matáayo 12:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lʉ́ka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Sikʉ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char> ɨmwɨ, Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe vajáa vakwaatɨra na mawundii ya ngáano. Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvalookáa na hara mawundii, vapooji vakaanda hʉʉnga maangala ya ngáano. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Mafarisáayo vakamʉsea Yéesu, “Laanga, sa che vapooji vaako voowuna Miiro ya sikʉ ya Sabáato?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">voowuna Miiro ya sikʉ ya Sabáato: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Miiro ya Vayahúudi kuwuna maangala yavɨrɨ yatatʉ iwundii kwa mʉʉntʉ sɨ vijáa vyakaaniwa tʉkʉ. Laanga </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 23:25</ref>.</char> Mafarisáayo sɨ vamuuryáa Yéesu sa che vapooji vaachwe vookiiva tʉkʉ, kɨɨntʉ ˆvamʉseáa nɨ sa che vapooji vaachwe vootʉmama mʉrɨmo wo chwa sikʉ ya Sabáato. Na Miiro ya Mʉ́sa yasea kusiina mʉʉntʉ kʉtʉmama sikʉ ya Sabáato tʉkʉ. Laanga <char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Ufumo 20:8-11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Maa akavasea, “Sɨ mʉnasoma vii tʉkʉ ˆcheene atʉmama mʉtemi <char style="w">Daúdi</char> mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa aávirwe nɨ njala na vaantʉ vaachwe wʉʉ? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Aho kalɨ, mpɨɨndɨ ja Abiasáari, <char style="w" lemma="Veeneɨsɨ">mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ</char>, Daúdi ɨɨngɨra na nyuumbii ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Samwéeli 21:1-6</ref>.</char></note> akarya mɨkáate ˆɨvɨ́ɨkwaa mbere ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, akavaheera baa na viivaachwe. Mɨkáate ɨyo, <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva vii noo vajáa varekerwa vɨndoorya. Vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ Miiro ɨjáa yakaanʼya kurya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Baa kei akavasea, “Sabáato yavɨɨkwa sa vaantʉ na sɨ vaantʉ sa Sabáato tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Sa jeyyo, Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ nɨ Mweeneevyo baa wa Sabáato.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ Sikʉ ya Sabáato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matáayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lʉ́ka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ajáa ɨɨngɨra kei na <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">sinagóogii</char>. Aho, kwajáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na mʉkono ˆwaakwya iyandiyandi. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Vamwɨ va vaantʉ ˆvajáa aho, vakaanda mʉlaangisha Yéesu, voone koonɨ arɨ mʉhorya ʉra mʉʉntʉ sikʉ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char>, sa vamusitaakye.<verse eid="MRK 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yéesu akamʉsea ʉra mʉʉntʉ mʉkono ˆwaakwya iyandiyandi, “Seesa, ɨma aha mbere ya vaantʉ voosi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Yéesu akavuurya, “Nɨ virikwi noo <char style="w">Miiro</char> yaruma tʉtʉmame sikʉ ya Sabáato? Kʉtʉmama mʉrɨmo mʉʉja, bakʉ kʉtʉmama mʉrɨmo mʉvɨ? Kʉlamurirya nkaasʉ, bakʉ kʉʉlaa?” Maa kaa, voovo sɨ vuuyirya kɨɨntʉ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Akavatuurirya miiso na nkalari, kʉnʉ yookoona ʉsʉʉngʉ sa ʉfafu wa mɨtɨma yaavo. Maa akamʉsea ʉra mʉʉntʉ, “Wolola mʉkono waako!” Ne akawolola mʉkono waachwe, ʉkava nkaasʉ kei! <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Hahara, vara <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> vakafuma na weerwii vakaanda kiiheera mɨryʉʉngʉ na mpuka ya vaantʉ va mʉtemi <char style="w">Heróode</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mpuka ya vaantʉ va mʉtemi Heróode: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ava nɨ vaantʉ va cháama ˆcheene chamutuubáa Heróode ˆmweene atawaláa sa Varúumi. Vaantʉ ava vasaakáa vamʉʉlae Yéesu sa voofáa ifaanaa akasʉmʉla ɨsɨ.</char></note> ˆvyeene varɨ mʉʉlaa Yéesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpuka ya Vaantʉ Yoomutuuba Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7-8"/>Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe vakiinʉka aho, vakadoma fʉʉrʉ mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva ra <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. Mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ vamutuubáa. Vaantʉ avo vajáa vafúmire kɨra haantʉ, ɨsɨ ja kʉlɨ na heehi, Galiláaya, <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char>, Yerusaléemu, Idumáaya, ɨsɨ yoosi nyambʉko ya luujii lwa Yorodáani, na va heehi na míiji ya <char style="w">Tíiro na Sidóoni</char>. Vaantʉ voosi avo, vʉʉja sa vajáa vatéɨɨre masáare ˆmeene Yéesu atʉmamáa. <verse eid="MRK 3:7-8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Yéesu akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Mbiikiri mashʉ́wa ɨmwɨ neeja, naambʉke, sa vaantʉ jo kʉʉnfenyenkererya.” <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Yéesu alʉʉsa jeyyo, sa ajáa avahóriirye vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo, na vaantʉ voosi vara ˆvajáa na ndwáala viifenyenkereryáa, sa vamʉsaasye. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/><char style="w">Mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char> ˆɨkamoone, yiivayyáa mbere yaachwe kʉnʉ yootʉla isóso yoosea, “Weewe ʉrɨ <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Yéesu akɨɨkaanʼya ɨrekereeke kwaarya masáare yaachwe kwa vaantʉ. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus teaching from the boat" file="CN01705B.TIF" size="col" copy="David c. Cook Publishing Co.1978" ref="3:9">Yéesu yookiindya fuma mashúwii</figure><verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovasaawʉla Vapooji Ikimi na Vavɨrɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matáayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lʉ́ka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Aho, Yéesu akaambʉka na luulwii, akavaanɨrɨra vara ˆveene yeeye avasaakáa, maa vakʉʉja na kʉrɨ yeeye. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Akavasaawʉla ikimi na vavɨrɨ, vave <char style="w">vatumwi</char> vaachwe, vandooyeendanʼya ne, sa ɨndoovatʉma no vavariyʉrɨra Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho. <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>Baa kei, vave na wiimiriri wo kibirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ. <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Na ava noo vatumwi ikimi na vavɨrɨ ˆveene Yéesu avasaawʉla: Simóoni, ˆmweene Yéesu amwaanɨrɨra <char style="w">Peéteri</char>, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Yaakúupu na Yooháani vala sha Sebedáayo ˆveene avaanɨrɨra Bonéege, noo kʉsea, “Vaana va kɨdandárɨka,” <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Anderéa na Filíipi, Batolomáayo, Matáayo, Tomáasi, Yaakúupu sha Alʉfáayo, Tedéei, Simóoni Mʉkanáani <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>na Yʉ́ʉda Isikarióoti ˆamʉvarindʉka Yéesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu na Belisebúuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Yéesu akahɨndʉka na kaayii, mpuka ya vaantʉ ɨkaanda kiijiinga kei, fʉʉrʉ yeeye na vapooji vaachwe vakasova baa nkalo yo rya chákurya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Kaayii kwaavo ˆvakateere masáare ˆmeene yalʉʉswáa, maa vakadoma noo mʉsʉmʉla sa viiseáa, “Asárire!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Hara mpukii, vajáa vamwaarɨ <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> ˆveene vajáa vafuma Yerusaléemu. Avo vakiindya vaseáa, “Ʉhʉ atɨɨte <char style="w">Belisebúuri</char>, na nɨ kwa lʉvɨro lwa <char style="w">Irimʉ</char> yookibirirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yéesu akavaanɨrɨra, akalʉʉsɨka novo kwa símo akavasea, “Joolɨ Irimʉ rɨrɨ daha kibirya Irimʉ mwiiwaachwe? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Koonɨ ʉtemi ʉmwɨ wiigávire haantʉ havɨrɨ kwiilwa woowo kwa woowo, ʉtemi ʉwo sɨ ʉrɨ lʉʉnga tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Baa kei, koonɨ lʉkolo lʉmwɨ lwiigáviregavire, ʉlo lʉkolo sɨ lʉrɨ lʉʉnga tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Noo jeyyo, koonɨ Irimʉ riikɨ́ɨkɨɨne rooreene na rɨve riigávire, sɨ rɨrɨ lʉʉnga tʉkʉ.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>Maa kaa, kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ daha kɨɨngɨra nyuumbii ya mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ na ngururu na anyahɨre máari jaachwe tʉkʉ, nɨ mpaka ta amuchuunge ʉwo mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ na ngururu, de adahe nyahɨra máari jaachwe ˆarɨ nojo.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, ʉvɨ woosi wa vaantʉ na <char style="w" lemma="Hɨɨntɨka">uhiintiki</char> waavo woosi Mʉlʉʉngʉ sea arɨ wasírire. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Maa kaa, mʉʉntʉ ˆmweene arɨ mʉhɨɨntɨkɨra <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char>, Mʉlʉʉngʉ sɨ arɨ sea ʉvɨ waachwe wasírire vii kaa tʉkʉ, na kʉva arɨ mʉvɨ kwa sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yéesu alʉʉsa jeyyo sa vajáa vamʉséire, “Atɨɨte murimʉ mʉvɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vandʉʉ va Yéesu na Íyo Waavo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matáayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lʉ́ka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi, akʉʉja íyo waala Yéesu na vaanaavo na Yéesu, vakɨɨma mbarɨmbarɨ, maa vakatʉma mʉʉntʉ amwaanɨrɨre. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Na vaantʉ ˆvajáa viíkyɨɨre vakamʉrɨɨngɨrɨra, vakamʉsea, “Íyo waanyu na vaanaanyu vamwaarɨ aha weerwii vookʉsaakɨra.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Maa Yéesu akavasea, “Íyo wiitʉ na vaaniitʉ noo vala ani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Akavalaanga vaantʉ ˆveene vajáa viíkyɨɨre vakamʉrɨɨngɨrɨra, maa akavasea, “Laangi! Ava ˆvarɨ aha noo vala íyo na vaaniitʉ. <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆatʉ́mamaa kʉsaaka kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ noo mwaaniitʉ, irʉʉmbʉ raanɨ na íyo wiitʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉhaandi Mbeyʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matáayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lʉ́ka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> akaanda variyʉla Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho kei mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva ra <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. Mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ vakiisaanka, vakamʉfenyenkererya mpaka akaambʉka mashʉ́wa irivii, maa akiikala. Vaantʉ voosi vakiikala mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Akava yoovavariyʉrɨra viintʉ ˆviri foo kwa símo, na mpɨɨndɨ ˆavavariyʉrɨráa akavasea, <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Teereri! Mʉhaandi ʉmwɨ ajáa adoma noo haanda mbeyʉ, <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>mpɨɨndɨ ˆamyaaháa, mbeyʉ jimwi jikawyɨɨra njirii, ndee jikʉʉja jikajirya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Jimwi jikawyɨɨra mwaalaliwyii kʉʉntʉ ˆkʉjáa kusiina salʉ jo keenererya, sa viintʉ salʉ sɨ jijáa jiri foo, jikamera chaangʉ. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Mwaasʉ ˆʉkavarɨke, jikashaawʉka, maa jikʉʉma sa viintʉ jijáa jisiina miriri. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Jimwi jikawyɨɨra haantʉ ˆhajáa na miíwa. Miíwa ˆɨkamere, ɨkajivaa, jikadundumala, maa jikadɨɨra vyaala ndɨɨwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Maa kaa, jimwaarɨ jimwi ˆjawyɨɨra salwii ˆjiri na seve, jikamera, jikakʉla, jikavyaala maatʉkʉ vii, jimwi jikavyaala mara makumi yatatʉ (30), jimwi mara makumi mʉsasatʉ (60) na jimwi mara makumi ikimi (100).” <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Maa akavasea, “ˆArɨ na matu yo teerera, nɨ ateere.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovariyʉla Símo Jaachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matáayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lʉ́ka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi, Yéesu ajáa na vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ, na vɨɨngɨ vajáa vamʉrɨ́ɨngɨrɨɨre, maa vakamuurya, “Símo jaako nɨ che joovariyʉla?” <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Ne akavasea, “Nyuunyu mwaheewa nkalo yo taanga viintʉ vya <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>, ˆvyeene vijáa fuumbo, maa kaa, vara sɨ ˆvarɨ Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, noovawyɨɨra kwa símo.<verse eid="MRK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>Sa kʉlaanga, valaange, baa koona tʉkʉ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Kʉteera vateere, baa taanga tʉkʉ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Sa ngaarɨ vajáa vateera no taanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">ngaarɨ vavarindʉka na vareka ʉvɨ waavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">na ngaarɨ ʉvɨ waavo wasira.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isáaya 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovariyʉla Lusímo lwa Mʉhaandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matáayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lʉ́ka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Aho, Yéesu akavuurya, “Sɨ mootaanga lusímo ʉlʉ tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Joolɨ de mʉrɨ taanga símo jɨɨngɨ? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Mʉhaandi wa mbeyʉ nɨ mʉʉntʉ ˆaváriyʉlaa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Mbeyʉ jira ˆjawyɨɨra njirii, nɨ ja vaantʉ vara ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ, hahara <char style="w">Irimʉ</char> rɨkʉʉja, maa rɨkajiseyya mitimii yaavo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Mbeyʉ jira ˆjawyɨɨra mawyii, nɨ ja vaantʉ vara ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ, na ˆvarɨhókeraa chaangʉ na cheerʉ. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Maa kaa, sɨ rɨvɨɨngɨ́raa mitimii tʉkʉ, sa viintʉ vasiina nkalo ya miriri, kiikala varɨ noro kiduudi vii. Na uturikiri ˆʉrɨ kʉʉja vii, varékaa kʉra kuruma kwaavo chaangʉ. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Na mbeyʉ jira ˆjawyɨɨra miíwii, nɨ ja vaantʉ ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>maa kaa, ʉhangaiki wa weerʉ, ʉkwaata wo kunguula máari na mpɨɨma ya viintʉ vyɨɨngɨ ˆviri foo, ivyo virifenyenkeryáa, rɨkareka kʉreeta kʉnáálo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Na mbeyʉ jira ˆjahaandwa sevii, noo vara vaantʉ ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ, vakarɨteengya, maa rɨkava na nkoonyo, jimwi jikavyaala mara makumi yatatʉ (30), jimwi mara makumi mʉsasatʉ (60), na jimwi mara makumi ikimi (100).”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Kɨmʉrɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Lʉ́ka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Yéesu akɨɨsea ɨra mpuka, “Eri, kɨmʉrɨ chʉʉ́jaa, kɨkavɨɨkwa iruungwii ra kɨtáanda wʉʉ? Bakʉ kɨkakʉnɨkɨrɨrwa na nyiingʉ ya kweenga wʉʉ? Tʉkʉ, nɨ kyaángwii kɨvɨ́ɨkwaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Sa kɨra kɨɨntʉ ˆchaviswa, vɨɨkwa kɨrɨ kɨweerwii, na kɨra ˆchakʉnɨkɨrɨrwa, kʉnʉkʉlwa kɨrɨ. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>ˆMweene arɨ na matu yo teerera, nɨ ateere!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Hara, maa akavasea kei, “Mʉyakwaatye neeja aya ˆmooyateera. Sa kipíimo ˆcheene mʉrɨ konkomala kʉteerera masáare ya Ijʉva, noo ˆvyeene baa nyuunyu mʉrɨ taanga, baa kei koongereriwa mʉrɨ. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Sa ʉra ˆarɨ na kɨɨntʉ, koongereriwa arɨ kʉlookya, na ʉra ˆasiina kɨɨntʉ, vuulwa arɨ baa kɨra kidúúdi ˆarɨ nocho.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mbeyʉ ˆVyeene Ɨméraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ nɨ ja jei ʉrɨ. Mʉʉntʉ aháandaa mbeyʉ iwundii. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>ˆArɨ hʉmʉla, baa alɨ́ɨre au arɨ miiso, mbeyʉ jaméraa no kʉla, yeeye baa taanga ˆvyeene vyavíjaa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Salʉ joongʼeene noo jibwéeyyaa jimere na jive mʉmero, jivyaale maangala, na maangala yave na mpeke. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Mpeke ˆjiri kangaala, ʉwo mʉʉntʉ atóolaa lufyo chaangʉ, sa mpɨɨndɨ jo chwa, jafíkire.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mpeke ya Haradáali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matáayo 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lʉ́ka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Kei akavasea, “Tʉʉfwaanirirye na che Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ? Bakʉ lusímo che tʉrɨ sima, sa tʉʉvariyʉle? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ ifaanaa tʉkʉʉfwaanirirya na mpeke ya <char style="w">haradáali</char>. Ɨhɨ nɨ mpeke ndudinduudi kʉlookya mpeke joosi jiháandwaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Maa kaa, koonɨ yaháandirwe, yavijáa mʉtɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya mɨtɨ yɨɨngɨ ya mbowa. Na yavijáa na matáampi makʉʉlʉ, baa ndee jindoojeenga vivururu mpehwii ja matáampii yaachwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Kwa símo ˆjiri foo ja iji, noo ˆvyeene Yéesu avariyʉláa isáare riija, ja ˆvyeene vaantʉ vadaháa taanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Sɨ avariyʉláa isáare roroosi ra Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ baa vasɨmɨra tʉkʉ, na mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa na vapooji vaachwe de ɨndoovavariyʉrɨra.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yootuurya Ihúmbuuto Irivii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matáayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lʉ́ka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Iwʉlo ra sikʉ yɨɨyo, Yéesu akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Hendi tʉfɨrɨre iriva tʉdome na nyambʉko.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Maa reerʉ, vakɨɨreka ɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ, vakakwaata njɨra na ɨra mashʉ́wa ˆngʼeene Yéesu ajáa ɨɨ́ngɨɨre, baa mashʉ́wa jɨɨngɨ jikamutuuba. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Ihúmbuuto ˆradalavadalaava rɨkaanda wuva, mapúunta ya maaji yakaringyaringya mashʉ́wa kende ɨmeme maaji. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Yéesu mweeneevyo ajáa alɨ́ɨre nyuma ya mashʉ́wa iisíkiriirye kimútwii. Vapooji vaachwe vakamwaanɨrɨra, voosea, “Mukiindya, toonyɨmɨra, tʉlaange.”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Aho, Yéesu akiinʉka, akarɨdalavya ihúmbuuto na akayasea mapúunta, “Kirinyi sawu! Mʉtʉʉle tʉ!” Hara, ihúmbuuto rɨkakirinya sawu, na maaji yakatʉʉla tʉ. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Yéesu akavuurya vapooji vaachwe, “Sa che mookoofa? Sɨ mʉnaanduma tʉkʉ wʉʉ?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Maa kaa, voovo vajáa vakwáatirwe nɨ woowa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, vookiiyurya, “De ʉhʉ nɨ ani, baa ihúmbuuto na mapúunta vyoomʉteera?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ ˆArɨ na Mirimʉ Mɨvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matáayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lʉ́ka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> na vapooji vaachwe vakafɨrɨra na nyambʉko ya iriva ra <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>, vakɨɨngɨra ɨsɨ ya Vageráasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Yéesu ˆakakiime vii hara mashúwii, mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆarɨ na <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char> afúmire <char style="w" lemma="Mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra">mbiríírii</char>, akʉʉja, maa akalʉmana ne. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Hara mbiríírii, noo kʉʉntʉ ʉwo mʉʉntʉ ˆiikaláa. Kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆadaháa kumuchuunga baa na mɨnyololo tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Achuungwáa na mɨnyololo mɨkonwii na pɨɨ́ngʉ mawulwii, ɨndoodʉmʉladʉmʉla, baa kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na ngururu jo mʉdaha tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Sikʉ joosi uchikʉ na muusi, iikaláa mbiríírii na njuulwii, yootʉla isóso no kiisanasana na mawye.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>ˆAkamoone Yéesu kʉʉra, akamʉkɨbɨrɨra, maa akachwaama mbere yaachwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>akatʉlatʉʉla isóso, yoosea, “Che woosaaka kʉrɨ nɨɨnɨ, weewe Yéesu <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> ˆArɨ Mweerimweeri? Hoonɨ ilahe kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, sɨ ʉrɨ kuunturikirya tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Walʉʉsa jei, sa viintʉ Yéesu ajáa ʉʉséire, “Murimʉ mʉvɨ, fuma kwa ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Maa Yéesu akuuyurya, “Ani ʉsewáa?” Nowo ukuuyirya, ʉkasea, “Irina raanɨ nɨ Mayana na Mayana ya Valwi Nkoondo sa viintʉ tʉrɨ foo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Murimʉ mʉvɨ ukiilomboola maatʉkʉ vii kʉrɨ Yéesu, karɨ iikibirye na ɨsɨ yɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Haaha, mbarɨmbarɨ ya lʉʉlʉ heehi na aho haantʉ, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte ufya wa nkaamba ˆjooriisha. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Ɨra mirimʉ mɨvɨ ɨkamʉloomba Yéesu, yoosea, “Tʉrekere, tʉkajɨɨngɨre jira nkaamba.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yéesu akɨɨrekera ɨra mirimʉ mɨvɨ, ɨkafuma, ɨkɨɨta kɨɨngɨra jira nkaamba. Mirimʉ mɨvɨ ɨkɨɨngɨre ʉra ufya wa nkaamba mayana yavɨrɨ (2,000), nkaamba jikiihuunta, jikagirita, jikabʉrʉkɨra irivii, maa jikakwya joosi vʉʉ.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Varíisi va jira nkaamba vakakʉʉrɨka itɨ́ɨjo, vakatwaala mʉlomo kwa vaantʉ ˆvajáa mawundii na múujii. Maa vakʉʉja noo laanga masáare ˆmeene yafʉ́mɨɨre. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>ˆVakafike kʉrɨ Yéesu, vakamoona ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na mayana na mayana ya mirimʉ mɨvɨ, iíkyɨɨre, iivɨ́kɨɨre ɨngo, arɨ baa na mɨryʉʉngʉ yaachwe, maa vakoofa. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Vara ˆveene viiyonera na miiso yaavo, vakavawyɨɨra vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ yara ˆmeene yajáa yafʉ́mɨɨre kwa ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na mirimʉ mɨvɨ, na jira nkaamba. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Aho, vakaanda mʉloomba Yéesu alooke hara ɨsɨ ya meevo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Yéesu ˆakaande kɨɨngɨra mashúwii, ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na mirimʉ mɨvɨ akiiloombererya atamanyanʼye na Yéesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Yéesu akamʉsɨɨtɨra, yoosea, “Doma na meenyu, ʉkavawyɨɨre vaantʉ va meenyu ˆvyeene Ijʉva akʉtʉ́mamɨɨre masáare makʉʉlʉ, na ˆvyeene akʉláangire na riiso ra wʉʉja.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Maa ʉra mʉʉntʉ akadoma, akaanda kaarya ʉko ɨsɨ ya Dekapóoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dekapóoli: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ isáare ra Kɨgiríki, noo kʉsea </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">míiji ikimi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Na vaantʉ ˆviikaláa ɨsɨ ya Dekapóoli sɨ vajáa Vayahúudi tʉkʉ.</char></note> ˆvyeene Yéesu ajáa amʉtʉ́mamɨɨre, maa vaantʉ voosi vakatʉlʉvala.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ Muki na Yoomʉfʉfʉla Muhíínja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matáayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lʉ́ka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Maa reerʉ, Yéesu akafɨrɨra na mashʉ́wa na nyambʉko ya iriva. ˆAkafike hara mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva, mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ɨkamʉrɨɨngɨrɨra. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Akʉʉja mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ, irina raachwe Yaíiro, ʉmwɨ wa vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">sinagóogi</char>. ˆAkamoone Yéesu, maa akawya majewii yaachwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>Akiilomboola, yoosea, “Aaɨ, kahíínja kaanɨ nɨ kalwɨ́ɨrɨ ka inkwya. Nookʉloomba tʉdomanʼye, ʉkakasaasye na mʉkono waako vii, kahole kave nkaasʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Maa vakiilongoorya na Yéesu. Ɨra mpuka ɨkava yoomutuuba na yoomufiinda. <verse eid="MRK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Aho, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ muki ˆajáa na ndwáala yo fuma sakami ˆɨrɨ foo kwa myaaka ikimi na ɨvɨrɨ. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Ajáa atʉrɨkɨra maatʉkʉ vii, sa ayeenda ʉwaangii akamala máari jaachwe joosi vʉʉ, baa hola tʉkʉ na ndwáala yaachwe ɨkakonkomala. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>ˆAkamʉteere Yéesu, akamutuuba kʉnʉ nyuma, akiifenyenkererya mpukii ya vaantʉ, maa akasaasya nkáancho yaachwe. <figure style="fig" alt="Woman touching Jesus cloak" file="lb00310c.tif" size="col" copy="The British &amp; Foregn Bible Society, 1994" ref="5:27">Mʉʉntʉ muki yoosaasya ɨngo ya Yéesu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Abweeyya jei sa iiseáa kɨmoyomooyo, “Koonɨ nasáasiirye ɨngo ya Yéesu vii, hola ndɨrɨ.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>ˆAkasaasye vii, sakami ɨkadeenʼya, akiiteera mʉvɨrɨ pwee, ahórire ɨra ndwáala yaachwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Hahara, Yéesu akataanga kwatɨɨte ngururu ˆjimufúmire, akavalandʉkɨra ɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ, maa akavuurya, “Nɨ ani asáasiirye ɨngo yaanɨ?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakamʉsea, “Aaɨ, sɨ wookoona viintʉ mpuka ya vaantʉ yookiifiinda tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Sa che wookuurya, ‘Nɨ ani asáasiirye ɨngo yaanɨ?’ ”<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Maa kaa, yeeye akadoomererya laangɨra sa amoone ˆmweene amʉsáasiirye. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki yootaanga ˆkɨmʉfʉ́mɨɨre, akiiturirya, akachwaama mbere ya Yéesu kʉnʉ yootetema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">yootetema: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ muki atetemáa sa iiseáa amʉbweeyyirye Yéesu ave na njeo baa kei ajáa awúnire Miiro ya Vayahúudi. Sa kwa Vayahúudi mʉʉntʉ muki kufuma sakami, kwabweeyyáa ave na njeo. Na sɨ yasaakwáa asaangɨre na vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ.</char></note> nɨ woowa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LEV 15:25-33">Valáawi 15:25-33</ref>.</char></note> Maa akalʉʉsa vyoosi ˆvimʉfʉ́mɨɨre. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Muhíínja waanɨ, kuruma kwaako kwakʉhóriirye. Tamanya na mwiikalo mʉʉja, ʉhole ndwáala yaako.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆajáa akaarɨ yoolʉʉsɨka, vakafika vaantʉ fuma kaayii kwa Yaíiro, ʉmwɨ wa vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va sinagóogi, maa vakamʉsea, “Muhíínja waako awʉ́lɨɨre. Amwɨ wootuuba mujuuwa mukiindya?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu sɨ ayakwaatya ayo masáare tʉkʉ, yeeye akamʉsea Yaíiro, “Kwiitweetya tʉkʉ, nduma nɨɨnɨ vii.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Akavasʉmʉla vala <char style="w">Peéteri</char>, Yaakúupu na Yooháani mudúúdi wa Yaakúupu vii, vamutuube. Akavakaanʼya vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ vareke kumutuuba. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>ˆVakafike kaayii kwa Yaíiro, vakateera ntáákwi, isóso, na vaantʉ voorɨra noo myaa. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Vakɨɨngɨra na nyuumbii, maa Yéesu akavasea, “Sa che mootʉla isóso no rɨra? Muhíínja sɨ akwíire tʉkʉ, nɨ alɨ́ɨre vii.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Voovo vakamʉseka Yéesu na heenchʉ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Maa kaa, Yéesu akavakibirya voosi vafume na weerwii, akavaanɨrɨra íyo na taáta waala muhíínja na vapooji ˆveene ajáa novo hara. Maa vakɨɨngɨra na hara haantʉ muhíínja ˆajáa aláariiwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Yéesu akamʉkwaata mʉkono muhíínja, maa akamʉsea, “<char style="it">Talíita, kúumi</char>,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:41 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Talíita, kúumi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɨhɨ nɨ ndʉʉsɨka ya Kɨaráamu, na noo ɨjáa ɨmwɨ ya ndʉʉsɨka ja Yéesu.</char></note> noo kʉsea, “Muhíínja, nakʉséire, inʉka!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Hahara, ʉra muhíínja akiinʉka, maa akaanda yeenda. Muhíínja ajáa atɨɨte myaaka ikimi na ɨvɨrɨ. ˆVakoone jeyyo, maa vakatʉlʉvala maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Yéesu akavakaanʼya, yoosea, “Karɨ mʉlʉ́ʉsaa ɨrɨ isáare kʉrɨ mʉʉntʉ baa ʉmwɨ vii tʉkʉ.” Maa akavasea vara vaantʉ vamʉheere chóorya ʉra muhíínja arye.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Vanasaréeti Voomusiita Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matáayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lʉ́ka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> akiinʉka fuma kwa Yaíiro, akadomanʼya na vapooji vaachwe fʉʉrʉ múujii wa Nasaréeti kʉʉntʉ ˆakʉrɨra. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Na sikʉ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char> ˆɨkafike, akaanda variyʉla Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">sinagóogii</char>. Vaantʉ va Nasaréeti ˆvarɨ foo ˆveene vamʉteereráa, vakatʉlʉvala, maa vakasea, “Ʉhʉ, hai ayatúriirye masáare aya? Na ʉlʉ lʉvɨro lo bweeyya myuujíisa? Tooti iji nɨ jirikwi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Eri, ʉhʉ sɨ ʉra mʉsóngoli mbáwo, mwaana wa Maríia tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Baa vandʉʉ vaachwe, sɨ vala Yaakúupu, Yóose, Yʉ́ʉda na Simóoni tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Na vandʉʉ vaachwe va kɨɨntʉ kiki, sɨ ava ˆtwiíkalaa novo aha?” Maa vakasiita muruma.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yéesu akavasea, “<char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">Mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> wa Ijʉva arúmwaa kɨra haantʉ, maa kaa, sɨ arúmwaa múujii meevo tʉkʉ, na kwa vandʉʉ vaachwe na kaayii kwaachwe tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Sa jeyyo, nɨ atʉmama myuujíisa mɨke vii, yo vavɨkɨra mɨkono valwɨ́ɨrɨ, novo vakahongera. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Akahwaalala maatʉkʉ vii, sa viintʉ sɨ vamuruma.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yéesu Yoovatʉma Vapooji Vaachwe Ikimi na Vavɨrɨ</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matáayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lʉ́ka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Hara, maa Yéesu akariinga maturii ya heehi na Nasaréeti meevo, kʉnʉ yoovavariyʉrɨra vaantʉ Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Akavaanɨrɨra vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ. Akavaheera wiimiriri mweeri ya <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char>. Akavatʉma vavɨrɨvɨrɨ, kʉnʉ <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>yoovalairirya, “Kati ˆmookera njɨra, karɨ mʉsʉ́mʉlaa muriwa tʉkʉ, baa chóorya tʉkʉ, baa kei karɨ mʉsʉ́mʉlaa mpía tʉkʉ, sumuli nkome vii, <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>na viráatʉ ivikiri, maa kaa, karɨ mʉsʉ́mʉlaa nkáancho ya kavɨrɨ tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Kei akavasea, “Kaaya ˆngʼeene mʉrɨ teengiwa ikali haaho, fʉʉrʉ sikʉ ˆmʉrɨ looka múuji ʉwo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Na haantʉ hohoosi ˆvarɨ siita vateengya no siita vateerera masáare yaanyu, looki na <char style="w" lemma="Konkoma marʉrɨ">ikonkomi marʉrɨ</char> majewii yaanyu, koonekya ʉvɨ waavo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakadoma, kʉnʉ voovariyʉla vaantʉ <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">vavalandʉke</char> fuma uvii waavo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Baa kei vakibiryáa mirimʉ mɨvɨ ˆɨrɨ foo, vavahakáa valwɨ́ɨrɨ makuta, novo vahongeráa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inkwya ya Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matáayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lʉ́ka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, mʉtemi <char style="w" lemma="Heróode">Heróode Antípaasi</char> akateera masáare ya Yéesu, sa viintʉ irina ra Yéesu ˆralʉʉswáa kɨra haantʉ. Vamwɨ va vaantʉ vaseáa, “Ʉhʉ nɨ Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji ˆafúfukire fuma inkwyii. Ɨkɨ noo ˆchooreka lʉvɨro lo bweeyya myuujíisa lʉrɨ ne.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Vamwɨ vaseáa, “Ʉhʉ nɨ <char style="w">Elía</char>, mʉláali na mʉtwe wa Ijʉva.” Kei vamwɨ vaseáa, “Ʉhʉ nɨ ja vara valáali na mʉtwe va Ijʉva va kalɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Maa kaa, Heróode ˆakateere masáare ayo, akasea, “Ʉhʉ nɨ ʉra ˆnamʉdʉmʉla mʉtwe, Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji. Afúfukire!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Heróode alʉʉsa jeyyo sa ʉko nyuma ajáa alairirya Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji akwaatwe, avɨɨkwe mʉnyololwii, sa Herodía. Ʉhʉ Herodía nɨ muki wa Filíipi, mwaanaavo na Heróode ajáa. Heróode ajáa amʉloola. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Na Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji amʉseáa Heróode, “<char style="w">Miiro</char> yakaanʼya weewe kʉmʉsʉmʉla muki wa mwaanaanyu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Sa jeyyo, Herodía akamʉvɨɨkɨra Yooháani ikuundi mutimii, asaakáa amʉʉlae, nkalo vii ɨndoosoveka. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Heróode amoofáa Yooháani sa ajáa ataanga Yooháani nɨ mʉwoloki na nɨ mʉʉja wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, maa ɨndoomukitirirya sa Herodía asiindwe kʉmʉʉlaa. Kei, Heróode ajáa eenda kʉteerera masáare ya Yooháani, baa neembe masáare yaachwe yamutuungyáa ʉsʉʉngʉ mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Maa reerʉ, nkalo ɨkatooreka. Sikʉ ɨyo, Heróode ajáa abwéeyyiirye ngovi yo kʉmbʉkɨra sikʉ ˆavyaalwa. Akavalaarɨka valʉme iiláangyaa novo sáare, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va valwi nkoondo na vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Aho ngovii, muhíínja wa Herodía akamʉvɨnɨra Heróode na vayeni vaachwe, maa vakavyeenda maatʉkʉ vii. Mʉtemi Heróode akamʉsea ʉra muhíínja, “Lʉʉsa kɨɨntʉ chochoosi ˆwoosaaka, nɨɨnɨ kʉheera ndɨrɨ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Akiilaha, yoosea, “Niiláhire! Kɨɨntʉ chochoosi ˆʉrɨ saaka, nɨɨnɨ kʉheera ndɨrɨ. Baa koonɨ nɨ kʉkʉkerera ɨsɨ ya ʉtemi waanɨ katɨ na katɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Maa ʉra muhíínja akafuma, akɨɨta muurya íyo waavo, “Nɨ kɨɨntʉ che ndɨrɨ loomba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Íyo waavo akamʉsea, “Mʉtwe wa Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji!”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Hahara, akahɨndʉka itɨ́ɨjo na kʉrɨ mʉtemi, maa akamʉsea, “Mpeera haaha vii, mʉtwe wa Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji ʉvɨ́kɨɨrwe ikaafii.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Mʉtemi akavisʉʉla maatʉkʉ vii. Maa kaa, sa viintʉ ajáa amwiiláhɨɨre mbere ja vayeni vaachwe, akasiindwa mʉsɨɨtɨra. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Hahara, mʉtemi Heróode akamʉtʉma mulwi nkoondo ʉmwɨ, akareete mʉtwe wa Yooháani. Ʉra mulwi nkoondo akɨɨngɨra na mʉnyololwii, akamʉdʉmʉla Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji mʉtwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Akavɨkɨra mʉtwe wa Yooháani ikaafii, maa akamʉtwaarɨra mwaana wa Herodía, ne akamʉkwaatya íyo waavo. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Na vapooji va Yooháani ˆvakateere ayo masáare, vakɨɨta sʉmʉla mʉvɨrɨ waachwe, maa vakɨɨta mʉtaaha <char style="w" lemma="Mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra">mbiríírii</char>.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooriisha Vaantʉ Valʉme Mayana Yasaano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matáayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lʉ́ka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yooháani 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>
    <char style="w">Vatumwi</char> va Yéesu ˆvakahɨndʉke, vakamuwyɨɨra Yéesu viintʉ vyoosi ˆvatʉ́mamire na ˆvyeene vakíindiirye. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Maa Yéesu akavasea, “Hendi, tʉdome na kijiraawii, mʉkahʉmʉlʉke kiduudi.” Alʉʉsa jei, sa hara haantʉ ˆvajáa, kwajáa kwatɨɨte vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo ˆvʉʉjáa no looka, vakasova baa nkalo yo rya. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Hara, vakiinʉka na mashʉ́wa, maa vakadoma na haantʉ ha tʉʉla kusiina vaantʉ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Maa kaa, vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vakavoona Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe voolooka, maa vakavataanga. Vakakʉʉrɨka na lwa kʉʉlʉ fuma míiji yoosi, vakadoma na kʉra kʉʉntʉ Yéesu ˆadomáa, maa vakalongoola fika. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yéesu ˆakakiime mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva, akoona mayɨɨmbɨ ya vaantʉ, akavoonera mbavariri sa vajáa nɨ ja muundi ˆjisiina muríisi. Maa, akaanda variyʉla masáare ˆyarɨ foo.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>ˆKʉkaande kʉswa, vapooji vakɨɨta kʉrɨ Yéesu, maa vakamʉsea, “Haantʉ aha nɨ kʉlɨ na kaaya ja vaantʉ, baa kei mwaasʉ waswɨ́ɨre. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Aaɨ, varekere vaantʉ, vakiiwʉrɨre vyóorya ʉko mawundii na maturii ˆyarɨ heehi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, “Vaheeri nyuunyu chóorya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Novo vakamʉsea, “Hai tʉrɨ fumya mpía ja <char style="w">dináari</char> magana yavɨrɨ (200) jo wʉrɨra chóorya cho viikutya vaantʉ voosi ava?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Akavuurya, “Mɨkáate ɨngaɨ mwatɨɨte? Hoonɨ kalaangi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">ˆVakahɨndʉke, maa vakamʉsea, “Ɨmwaarɨ mɨkáate ɨsaano na soompa ivɨrɨ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Maa akavalairirya, vaviikarye vaantʉ kɨtoongetoonge masaambii. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Vaantʉ novo vakiikala vitoonge vya vaantʉ makumi yasaanosaano (50) na makumi ikimikimi (100).<verse eid="MRK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Yéesu akatoola ɨra mɨkáate ɨsaano na jira soompa ivɨrɨ. Akiinurirya miiso yaachwe na kurumwii yoomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Akabendʉlabendʉla ɨra mɨkáate ɨsaano, maa akavaheera vapooji vaachwe novo vakavaheera vaantʉ. Baa na jira soompa ivɨrɨ akabweeyya vivira. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Vaantʉ voosi vakarya, vakiikuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Vapooji vakatoorera mabéendʉ ya mɨkáate, vakamemya vikápu ikimi na vivɨrɨ. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Vaantʉ ˆvaarya vajáa vamema maatʉkʉ vii, vaantʉ valʉme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">vaantʉ valʉme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vayahúudi vavaláa vaantʉ valʉme vii, maa kaa, kwajáa kwatɨɨte vaantʉ vaki na vasinga ˆvaarya ɨyo mɨkáate na soompa.</char></note> vii nɨ mayana yasaano (5,000) vajáa.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooyeendera Mweeri ya Maaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matáayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yooháani 6:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Hahara vii, Yéesu akavadoomererya vapooji vaachwe, vaambʉke mashʉ́wa, valongoole na iturii ra Besaída, nyambʉko ya iriva ra Galiláaya. Yeeye akachaala yookiiteengʉla na ɨra mpuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Vaantʉ ˆvakalooke, akaambʉka na luulwii noo mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="MRK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ja iwʉlo, mashʉ́wa ɨjáa yafíkire katɨ na katɨ ya iriva, na Yéesu ajáa achɨ́hɨɨre yeemweene luulwii. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Maa akavoona vapooji vaachwe kʉʉra vootʉrɨkɨra kʉtwaala mashʉ́wa na mbere, sa ihúmbuuto rawuváa fuma mbere yaavo. ˆƗkafike namuyiingʉ, Yéesu akavatuuba na katɨkatɨ ya iriva yooyeendera mweeri ya maaji, akava yoosaaka valooka. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Maa kaa, ˆvakamoone yooyeenda mweeri ya maaji, vakiisea nɨ murimʉ. Aho, vakaanda kwaana ntáákwi, <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>sa ˆvakamoone, voosi vajáa viivʉndʉka maatʉkʉ vii. Hahara, maa akavasea, “Fafyi mɨtɨma, nɨ nɨɨnɨ, koofi tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Yéesu akaambʉka na mashúwii hamwɨ novo, aho, maa ihúmbuuto rɨkaherya. Vapooji vaachwe vakatʉlʉvala maatʉkʉ vii, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>sa vajáa vakaarɨ taanga ʉra muujíisa wa mɨkáate na mɨtɨma yaavo ɨjáa ɨkaarɨ yafafa.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovahorya Valwɨ́ɨrɨ ʉko Genesaréeti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matáayo 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe ˆvakafɨrɨre iriva ra Galiláaya, maa vakafika ɨsɨ ya Genesaréeti, aho, vakiimya mashʉ́wa. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>ˆVakakiime vii mashúwii, maa vaantʉ vakamʉtaanga Yéesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Vakarɨɨngɨrɨra chaangʉ ɨsɨ yoosi, na vakatoola valwɨ́ɨrɨ na ndɨrɨ jaavo, maa vakavatwaala na kʉʉntʉ ˆvateeráa Yéesu amwaarɨ. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Kɨra múuji, ituri, na miwundii, noo kʉsea, kɨra haantʉ Yéesu ˆadomáa, vaantʉ vavavɨɨkáa valwɨ́ɨrɨ vaavo gurii. Na vamʉloombáa, avarekere valwɨ́ɨrɨ vasaasye baa mʉkáwo wa ɨngo yaachwe vii. Na voosi ˆvasaasya ɨngo yaachwe, vahongera.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Miiro yo Tuuba nɨ ya Ijʉva sɨ ya Vaantʉ Tʉkʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matáayo 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, vamwɨ va <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> fuma Yerusaléemu, vajáa viisaanka mbere ya <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Aho, vakavoona vamwɨ va vapooji va Yéesu, voorya chóorya na mɨkono ˆɨrɨ na <char style="w">njeo</char>, noo kʉsea, baa kooyya mɨkono ja ˆvyeene vyasáakwaa tʉkʉ.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Mafarisáayo na <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char> voosi koonɨ sɨ vanooyya mɨkono ja ˆvyeene vyasaakwa, sɨ varijáa tʉkʉ, kutuuba nkʉʉngʉ ya vala baaba waavo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvafúmire sokóonii, sɨ varíjaa kɨɨntʉ chochoosi tʉkʉ mpaka vooyye mɨkono kʉseyya njeo. Na vatɨɨte nkʉʉngʉ jɨɨngɨ ˆjiri foo vii ˆvatúubaa, baa ja yo kooyya ndʉvo, nyiingʉ na saama ja sháaba.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Aho, Mafarisáayo na vakiindya va Miiro vakamʉsea Yéesu, “Eri, sa che vapooji vaako sɨ vatúubaa nkʉʉngʉ ja vala baaba, vandoorya na mɨkono ˆɨrɨ na njeo?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Maa Yéesu akavasea, “<char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">Mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> wa Ijʉva Isáaya alʉʉsa kɨmaarɨ mpɨɨndɨ ˆalaaláa na mʉtwe sa nyuunyu vakweembi ja ˆvyeene Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yalʉʉsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Vaantʉ ava vaanyémyaa na mɨlomo vii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">maa kaa, mɨtɨma yaavo ɨrɨ kʉlɨ na nɨɨnɨ.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Kuunyinamɨra kwaavo nɨ ja kisiina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">sa nɨ vavariyʉláa ndairiri ja vaantʉ vii.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isáaya 29:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Kɨmaarɨ, mwarékire ndairiri ja Mʉlʉʉngʉ maa mʉkakwaatɨrɨra nkʉʉngʉ ˆjavɨɨkwa nɨ vaantʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Akavasea kei, “Mwamányire pala ndairiri ja Mʉlʉʉngʉ kɨweere sa mutuube nkʉʉngʉ jaanyu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/><char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> mʉláali na mʉtwe wa Ijʉva asea, ‘Ʉvanyemye vala íyo na taáta waanyu,’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10a </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ufumo 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 5:16</ref>.</char></note> na ‘Ʉra <char style="w" lemma="Tʉkɨra">ˆarɨ mʉtʉkɨra</char> íyo au taáta waavo, ʉʉlawe.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10b </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Ufumo 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Valáawi 20:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Maa kaa, nyuunyu mʉndoovavariyʉrɨra vaantʉ, vandoovasea vala íyo na taáta waavo, ‘Haɨ, sɨ ndɨrɨ daha kʉvaambirirya tʉkʉ, sa ɨkɨ ˆnatɨɨte nɨ Korobáani, noo kʉsea, <char style="w">kɨlʉngʉlʉngʉ</char> ˆnakera na ivarwii sa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>Jeyyo, noo vyahérire, kusiina kʉvaambirirya vala íyo na taáta waavo tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Jeyyo, noo ˆvyeene muchwíjaa matɨ isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ sa nkʉʉngʉ jaanyu ˆmwiihéereryaa. Baa kei, vimwaarɨ viintʉ ˆviri foo vii ˆmʉtʉ́mamaa ˆviifwɨ́ɨne na ivyo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Viintʉ ˆVibwéeyyaa Mʉʉntʉ Ave na Njeo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matáayo 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Aho, Yéesu akavaanɨrɨra vaantʉ, akavasea, “Voosi kɨra ʉmwɨ waanyu nteereri neeja, mʉtaange ɨkɨ. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Kusiina kɨɨntʉ ˆkɨmwɨɨ́ngɨraa mʉʉntʉ ˆkɨdáhaa mʉbweeyya ave na njeo tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, ˆkimufúmaa mutimii noo kɨmʉbwéeyyaa ave na njeo. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>ˆArɨ na matu nɨ ateere.]”<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>ˆAkiireke na ɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ, akɨɨngɨra na nyuumbii, maa vapooji vaachwe vakamʉsea avariyʉle lʉra lusímo lwaachwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Ne akavasea, “Baa nyuunyu sɨ mootaanga tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Sɨ mootaanga kusiina kɨɨntʉ baa kɨmwɨ ˆkɨmwɨɨ́ngɨraa mʉʉntʉ ˆkɨrɨ mʉbweeyya ave na njeo tʉkʉ wʉʉ? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Sa koonɨ mʉʉntʉ aríire kɨɨntʉ, sɨ kɨmwɨɨngɨráa na mutimii tʉkʉ, nɨ kɨmwɨɨngɨráa na indii vii, maa kɨkafuma kɨkatwaalwa na chóowii.” ˆAkalʉʉse jei, akava aséire vyóorya vyoosi vʉʉ, visiina njeo tʉkʉ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LEV 11">Valáawi 11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Akoongererya, yoosea, “ˆKimufúmaa mʉʉntʉ fuma mutimii noo ˆkɨmʉbwéeyyaa ave na njeo. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Sa kufuma mutimii wa mʉʉntʉ, yafúmaa miiririkano mɨvɨ, ʉhanguti, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>wiivi, wʉʉlaishi, kʉyeenda na muki wa mʉʉntʉ, kʉkwaata matu, kʉbweeyya ʉvɨ, ʉkwaata, kʉyeenda ja kúri, kɨvɨna, kʉtʉkɨra, kwiivaa kɨpeembe na ʉkoókoyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Ʉvɨ woosi ʉhʉ nɨ mutimii ufúmaa na noo ʉbwéeyyaa mʉʉntʉ ave na njeo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuruma kwa Maáma sɨ ˆArɨ Mʉyahúudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matáayo 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Hara, maa Yéesu akakwaata njɨra, akadoma fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ ja <char style="w">Tíiro na Sidóoni</char>. ˆAkafike, akɨɨngɨra nyuumba ɨmwɨ na sɨ asaakáa mʉʉntʉ baa ʉmwɨ ataange koonɨ amwaarɨ tʉkʉ, maa kaa, vyasɨɨndɨkana kwiivisa.<verse eid="MRK 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25-26"/>Kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ muki ʉmwɨ Mugiríki fuma ɨsɨ ya Síria Foiníike, ajáa na kahíínja kaachwe ˆkarɨ na <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char>. ˆAkateere Yéesu amwaarɨ, akafweenga fʉʉrʉ kʉrɨ Yéesu, akachwaama mbere yaachwe, maa akamʉloomba Yéesu akaseyye kahíínja kaachwe mirimʉ mɨvɨ.<verse eid="MRK 7:25-26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Maa Yéesu akamʉyera ʉra maáma, “Reka ta nɨvaambirirye Vayahúudi viivaanɨ. Sɨ vyabooha kʉtoola chóorya cha vasinga na ujiheere kúri tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Ʉra maáma akasea, “Nɨ kɨmáárɨ ulúusire, maa kaa, baa kúri iruungwii ra méesa, jaríjaa mangʼenyengʼenye ya chóorya cha vasinga.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Maa Yéesu akamʉsea, “Sa viintʉ wuúyiirye vyabooha, doma na kaayii, murimʉ mʉvɨ wamufúmire muhíínja waako.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>ˆAkafike kaayii kwaachwe, akakashaana kahíínja kaachwe kahúmulukire kɨtáandii, murimʉ mʉvɨ wafúmire.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Kɨmatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Aho, Yéesu akiinʉka fuma ɨsɨ ya Tíiro akakwaata na katɨ na katɨ ya Sidóoni, maa akadoma na ɨsɨ ya Dekapóoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dekapóoli: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ isáare ra Kɨgiríki, noo kʉsea </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">míiji ikimi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Na vaantʉ ˆviikaláa ɨsɨ ya Dekapóoli sɨ vajáa Vayahúudi tʉkʉ.</char></note> fʉʉrʉ iriva ra <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Kɨmatu ʉmwɨ sɨ ˆadáhaa lʉʉsɨka neeja akareetwa nɨ vaantʉ, maa vakamʉloomba Yéesu amʉvɨkɨre mɨkono sa ahole.<verse eid="MRK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yéesu akamʉtwaala na ivarwii ʉra kɨmatu kʉlɨ na vaantʉ. Akamʉvɨkɨra maamba jaachwe matwii, akachwɨɨra matɨ mamaambii, maa akamʉsaasya lurimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Akalaanga kurumwii, maa akakeeha nɨ ʉsʉʉngʉ akamʉsea, “<char style="it">Efáata!</char>” noo kʉsea, “Yʉʉrɨka.” <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Hahara matu yaachwe yakayʉʉrɨka na lurimi lwaachwe lʉkachʉngʉlʉka, akaanda lʉʉsɨka neeja.<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yéesu akavakaanʼya vaantʉ vara ˆvajáa hara akavasea, “Sɨ mʉyalʉʉse masáare aya kʉrɨ mʉʉntʉ baa ʉmwɨ vii tʉkʉ.” Maa kaa, ja ˆvyeene avakaanʼyáa kʉlʉʉsa, noo ˆvyeene valookyáa kwaarya ayo masáare. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Vaantʉ vakatʉlʉvala mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ voosea, “Viintʉ vyoosi ˆatʉ́mamire vyabooha maatʉkʉ vii! Baa vimatu abwéeyyiirye vandooteera na vimumu vandoolʉʉsɨka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovariisha Vaantʉ Mayana Yanɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matáayo 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Sikʉ jijira, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ajáa na mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ. Sa viintʉ vajáa vasiina chóorya, Yéesu akavaanɨrɨra vapooji vaachwe akavasea, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Arumi, noovoonera mbavariri ava vaantʉ, viíkyɨɨre na nɨɨnɨ aha sikʉ itatʉ na vasiina chóorya tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Koonɨ navarékire vadome na njala na kaayii, yɨrɨka varɨ nɨ njala njirii sa vamwɨ vafumiré kʉlɨ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakamʉsea, “Hai tʉrɨ fumya chóorya cho viikutya vaantʉ voosi ava aha nyikii?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Yéesu akavuurya, “Mɨkáate ɨngaɨ mwatɨɨte?” Novo vakasea, “Mufungatɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Akavalairirya vaantʉ viikale ɨsɨ. Akatoola ɨra mɨkáate mufungatɨ, akamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, akabendʉlabendʉla, sa vavagavɨre vaantʉ. Novo vapooji vakabweeyya jeyyo. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Na kei vajáa vatɨɨte fisoompa fingaɨ vii. Akafitalarya, maa akavalairirya vapooji vaachwe vavaheere vaantʉ. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Vaantʉ vaarya, vakiikuta. ˆVakahʉmʉle, vakatoorera mabéendʉ ya mɨkáate ˆɨchɨ́hɨɨre, vakamemya vikápu mufungatɨ. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Vaantʉ ˆvaarya nɨ ja mayana yanɨ (4,000) vajáa. Hara, maa akasuukya. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Akaambʉka mashʉ́wa hamwɨ na vapooji vaachwe, maa vakafɨrɨra fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ ya Dalumanúuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mafarisáayo Voosaaka Valaɨrwe Isháara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matáayo 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>
    <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> vakʉʉja, maa vakaanda kwiiruta ne ndihi, voosaaka isháara fuma kurumwii sa vamʉtee. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yéesu ˆakateere masáare yaavo, akakeeha na ʉsʉʉngʉ, maa akavasea, “Sa che mbyaala ɨhɨ yooloomba isháara? Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, mbyaala ɨhɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ kɨɨheera isháara tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>ˆAkavareke, akaambʉka mashʉ́wa, maa akakwaata njɨra fʉʉrʉ nyambʉko ya iriva.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ʉsasɨ wa Mʉtemi Heróode na Mafarisáayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matáayo 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Vapooji vajáa varímiirye sʉmʉla mɨkáate, na hara mashúwii, vajáa vatɨɨte mʉkáate umudu vii. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yéesu akavalʉma kutu yoovasea, “Mʉlaange neeja, mʉnehe ʉsasɨ wa Mafarisáayo na wa <char style="w">Heróode</char>.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakaanda kiiwyɨɨra vooveene voosea, “Alúusire jei sa viintʉ tusiina mɨkáate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yéesu akataanga kʉlʉʉsɨka kwaavo, maa akavuurya, “Sa che mookiiruta ndihi sa viintʉ musiina mɨkáate? Eri, mʉkaarɨ sɨ mʉnataanga no vyoona tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Sa che mwafafya mɨtɨma jei? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Amwɨ mwatɨɨte miiso, sɨ mookoona viintʉ ˆnoovariyʉla tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Na matu mwatɨɨte, sɨ mooteera viintʉ ˆnoovariyʉla tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Sɨ moodaha kʉmbʉkɨra baa kimudu vii tʉkʉ wʉʉ? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmbéndwɨɨrembendwɨɨre ɨra mɨkáate ɨsaano nkavaheera vaantʉ mayana yasaano (5,000), nɨ vikápu yangaɨ mwamemya ya mabéendʉ ya mɨkáate?” Maa vakuuyirya, “Ikimi na vivɨrɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>“Ha mpɨɨndɨ ˆnkabendʉlebendʉle mɨkáate mufungatɨ, maa nkavaheera vaantʉ mayana yanɨ (4,000), mwatoorera vikápu vingaɨ vya mabéendʉ ya mɨkáate?” Vakasea, “Mufungatɨ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Maa akavuurya, “Mʉkaarɨ vii sɨ mootaanga tʉkʉ viintʉ ˆnoovariyʉla wʉʉ?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉhoku ʉko Besaída</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Maa reerʉ, Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe vakafika ituri ra Besaída. Vaantʉ vamwɨ vakareeta mʉhoku ʉmwɨ, maa vakamʉloomba Yéesu amʉsaasye. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yéesu akamʉkwaata mʉkono, maa akamʉtwaala na ivarwii ra ituri. Akamʉchwɨɨra matɨ miiswii, akamʉvɨkɨra mɨkono, maa akamuurya, “Koona wiise kɨɨntʉ chochoosi wʉʉ?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Ʉra mʉhoku akalaanga, maa akamʉsea, “Nookoona vaantʉ, maa kaa, varɨ ja mɨtɨ ˆyooyeenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Kei Yéesu akamʉvɨkɨra mɨkono miiswii, ne akatuurya miiso, maa akoona kɨra kɨɨntʉ neeja. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Hara, maa Yéesu akamʉsea, “Doma na kaayii na kaja ʉtwéeraa na iturii tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peéteri Yoomʉtaanga Yéesu nɨ Masía</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matáayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lʉ́ka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Aho, Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe vakiinʉka, maa vakadoma fʉʉrʉ maturi ya Kaisaría Filíipi. Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa njirii, Yéesu akavuurya, “Eri, vaantʉ vaséaa nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ ani?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Maa vakamʉsea, “Vamwɨ vaséaa weewe ʉrɨ Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji, na vɨɨngɨ vaséaa ʉrɨ <char style="w">Elía</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> wa Ijʉva, baa kei vɨɨngɨ vaséaa ʉrɨ ʉmwɨ wa valáali na mʉtwe va Ijʉva.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Maa akavuurya, “Ha nyuunyu, mwiiséaa nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ ani?” <char style="w">Peéteri</char> akuuyirya, yoosea, “Weewe noo <char style="w">Masía</char>.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Yéesu akavakaanʼya yoosea, “Karɨ mumuwyɨ́ɨraa mʉʉntʉ baa ʉmwɨ masáare aya tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolʉʉsɨkɨra Inkwya Yaachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matáayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lʉ́ka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Yéesu akaanda vavariyʉrɨra vapooji vaachwe, yoosea, “<char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char>, nɨ mpaka aturikiriwe mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, baa kei siitwa arɨ nɨ vawosi, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char>, na kʉʉlawa arɨ. Na sikʉ ya katatʉ fʉfʉlwa arɨ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Avawyɨɨráa masáare aya kɨweerwii, baa vavisa tʉkʉ. Peéteri akamʉsʉmʉla na ivarwii, maa akaanda mʉbaamirirya areke lʉʉsa masáare ayo. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Yéesu akiilorera akavalaanga vapooji vaachwe, maa akamwaamirirya Peéteri, yoosea, “<char style="w">Irimʉ</char>, isunke mbere yaanɨ, sɨ wookiiririkana masáare ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ tʉkʉ, wookiiririkana ya vaantʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Koonɨ Woosaaka Mutuuba Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Akavaanɨrɨra vapooji vaachwe na ɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ akavasea, “Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi yoosaaka aantuube, nɨ mpaka iisiite yeemweene, avaale <char style="w">mʉsaláaba</char> waachwe, aantuube. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Sa mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆyoosaaka lamurirya nkaasʉ yaachwe, kɨɨtaaha arɨ, maa kaa, yoyoosi ʉra ˆyookɨɨtaaha nkaasʉ yaachwe sa nɨɨnɨ na <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char>, ʉwo kɨɨlamurirya arɨ.<verse eid="MRK 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Kwatɨɨte kʉnáálo che mʉʉntʉ kuturya weerʉ yoosi no kɨɨtaaha nkaasʉ yaachwe? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Bakʉ nɨ kɨɨntʉ che mʉʉntʉ arɨ toola sa nkaasʉ yaachwe? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi aanyónɨɨre soni nɨɨnɨ na masáare yaanɨ mbere ja ɨhɨ mbyaala mbɨ ya vaantʉ ˆvayéendaa na vaki va vaantʉ, Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ ne moonera arɨ soni, mpɨɨndɨ ˆakuújire na nkongojima ya Taáta na <char style="w">mirimʉ miija</char>.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Maa <char style="w">Yéesu</char> akavasea jei, “Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, vamwaarɨ vɨɨngɨ ˆviímire aha, baa sɨ vanaakwya, kʉʉyona varɨ <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> wuújire na ngururu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovalandʉka Buuwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matáayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lʉ́ka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Sikʉ mʉsasatʉ ˆjikalooke, Yéesu akavasʉmʉla vala <char style="w">Peéteri</char>, Yaakúupu na Yooháani fʉʉrʉ ncholwii ya lʉʉlʉ kijiraawii. Ʉko, Yéesu akavalandʉka buuwo mbere yaavo. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Ɨngo jaachwe jikava njerʉ chwee, jindoolavalava, kusiina mufuli baa ʉmwɨ vii aha weerwii, ˆarɨ daha fula jeere jeyyo tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Aho, <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> na <char style="w">Elía</char> vakavafʉmɨra, vakaanda lʉʉsɨka ne.<verse eid="MRK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Peéteri ˆakoone jeyyo, maa akamʉsea Yéesu, “Mukiindya, vyabooha viintʉ ˆtʉrɨ aha, haaha tʉjeenge vivaanda vitatʉ, kɨmwɨ chaako, kɨmwɨ cha Mʉ́sa na kɨmwɨ cha Elía.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Peéteri alʉʉsa jeyyo, sa viintʉ yeeye na viivaachwe voofáa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, akasiindwa taanga cho lʉʉsa.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Hara, maa ichu rɨkafʉmɨra, rɨkavawɨɨkɨra na sawúti ɨkafuma aho ichwii yoosea, “Ʉhʉ nɨ Mwaana waanɨ ˆnamweenda, mʉteereri yeeye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Hahara, vapooji vakalaanga kʉnʉ na kʉnʉ, baa sɨ vamoona mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ, vakamoona Yéesu yeemweene vii.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ˆvagiritáa fuma luulwii, Yéesu akavakaanʼya akavasea, “Karɨ mʉlʉ́ʉsaa aya masáare ˆmwɨɨ́ne tʉkʉ, fʉʉrʉ haantʉ <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> ˆakafʉ́fwɨɨrwe fuma inkwyii.” <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Vakarɨkwaatya ɨro isáare, kʉnʉ vookiiyurya vooveene, “Kʉfʉfʉka fuma inkwyii noo kɨɨntʉ che?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Hara, maa vakamuurya Yéesu, “Amwɨ <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> vaséaa, nɨ mpaka Elía ʉʉje ta?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="MAL 4:5-6">Maláaki 4:5-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Maa akavasea, “Nɨ kɨmáárɨ, Elía kʉʉja arɨ ta jɨ iimye neeja kɨra kɨɨntʉ. Sa che kei Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yalʉʉsa, nɨ mpaka Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ aturikiriwe mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, baa kei achwɨɨwe matɨ? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Nɨ kɨmaarɨ kaa noovawyɨɨra, Elía<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="MAT 11:13-14">Matáayo 11:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2-4">Maáriki 1:2-4</ref>.</char></note> ʉʉja, novo vakamuturikirya na heno ja ˆvyeene veenda, ja ˆvyeene Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yalʉʉsa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉtavana ˆArɨ na Murimʉ Mʉvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matáayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Lʉ́ka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Yéesu na vara vapooji vaachwe vatatʉ ˆvakakiime lʉʉlʉ, vakavashaana vara vapooji vɨɨngɨ ˆviijíingɨrɨɨrwe nɨ mpuka ya vaantʉ, na vamwɨ va vakiindya va Miiro, vookiiruta ndihi novo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Vara vaantʉ ˆvakamoone Yéesu, vakahwaalala maatʉkʉ vii, maa vakamʉkɨbɨrɨra, vakɨɨta muluumbya. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yéesu akavuurya, “Nɨ che mookiirʉtɨra ndihi novo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Maa ʉmwɨ wa ɨra mpuka akuuyirya, yoosea, “Mukiindya, naréetire mʉtavana waanɨ, atɨɨte <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ mɨvɨ">murimʉ mʉvɨ</char> ˆumudúngyaa mʉlomo asiindwe lʉʉsɨka. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Kɨra ˆʉrɨ kiinʉka wamʉváyyaa ɨsɨ, maa ɨndootuumpa ifulo no sha mayeo, kei ɨndoofafa bʉʉ. Haaha navalóombire vapooji vaako vamʉseyye ʉwo murimʉ mʉvɨ, maa kaa, vasíindirwe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yéesu ˆakateere jeyyo, maa akavasea, “Aka! Ɨhɨ mbyaala sɨ ˆirúmaa, niikale na nyuunyu mpaka naadi? Na nɨvayimirirye mpaka naadi? Hoonɨ mʉreeti na aha.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Maa vakamʉtwaala na kʉrɨ Yéesu. Murimʉ mʉvɨ ˆʉkamoone Yéesu vii, ʉkamʉkwaatya ʉra mʉtavana kiinkwiisha, akawya na ɨsɨ. Akaanda kwiiwalaarya kʉnʉ yootuumpa ifulo.<verse eid="MRK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Maa Yéesu akamuurya taáta waala ʉwo mʉtavana, “Masáare aya yamwaanda keende naadi?” Akasea, “Keende udúúdi waachwe. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Na ˆkarɨ foo ʉhʉ murimʉ mʉvɨ wamʉváyyaa mootwii na luujii sa ʉmʉʉlae. Haaha koonɨ ʉrɨ daha, tooloomba ʉtoonere mbavariri, ʉtwaambirirye.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Maa Yéesu akamʉsea, “Atɨ koonɨ ndɨrɨ daha? Viintʉ vyoosi kwaanɨ vyadáhɨkaa kwa ʉra ˆmweene arɨ kuunduma.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Maa taáta waala ʉra mʉtavana akalʉʉsa na ngururu, yoosea, “Narúmire, nyambirirya ndahe seyya miiririkano yo dɨɨra kukuruma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yéesu ˆakoone ɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ yookʉla, akʉʉyamirirya ʉra murimʉ mʉvɨ, yoosea, “We murimʉ mʉvɨ kimumu na kɨmatu. Nakʉséire ufume baa kei kusiina luu mwɨɨngɨra ʉhʉ mʉtavana tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Aho, ʉra murimʉ mʉvɨ ʉkatʉla isóso, ʉkamusukasuka na ngururu ʉra mʉtavana, ʉkamʉrekera, maa akava ja akwíire. Baa vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ vakasea, “Amwɨ akwíire!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akamʉkwaata mʉkono, akamwiinʉla, ne akiinʉka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe vakɨɨngɨra na nyuumbii, maa vakaanda muurya Yéesu kʉnʉ varɨ vooveene, “Sa che suusu tasíindirwe mʉseyya murimʉ mʉvɨ?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Maa akavasea, “Murimʉ mʉvɨ ˆʉrɨ jeyyo, sɨ ʉséyyiwaa jei vii tʉkʉ, nɨ mpaka mʉlʉʉsɨke na Ijʉva.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolʉʉsɨkɨra kei Inkwya na Ʉfʉfʉ́ʉko Waachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matáayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Lʉ́ka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Hara, maa Yéesu na vapooji vakiinʉka, vakakwaatɨra na ɨsɨ ya <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. Maa kaa, Yéesu sɨ asaakáa mʉʉntʉ baa ʉmwɨ ataange haantʉ ˆvarɨ tʉkʉ, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>sa asaakáa ave na vapooji vaachwe, ɨndoovavariyʉrɨra masáare ayo. Akavavariyʉrɨra, yoovasea, “Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ, vɨɨkwa arɨ mɨkonwii ya vaantʉ, novo kʉmʉʉlaa varɨ, na sikʉ ya katatʉ, fʉfʉlwa arɨ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Maa kaa, vapooji vaachwe, sɨ vataangáa ˆcheene alʉʉsɨkáa tʉkʉ, kei voofáa kumuurya.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ani nɨ Mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matáayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lʉ́ka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Maa reerʉ, vakafika ɨsɨ ya Kaperenáumu. Vakɨɨngɨra na nyuumbii, maa Yéesu akavuurya, “Che mwaakiirʉtɨra ndihi kʉra njirii?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Maa voovo vakakirinya sawu, baa kuuyirya tʉkʉ, sa vajáa vatáangire kɨɨntʉ ˆviirʉtɨráa ndihi kʉra njirii, nɨ ani noo mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ.<verse eid="MRK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yéesu akiikala, akavakemera vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ, maa akavasea, “Mʉʉntʉ ˆyoosaaka ave mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ, yoosaakwa iihetye nyuma, na avatʉmamɨre viivaachwe voosi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Aho, akamʉreeta musinga muduudi, akamwiimya katɨ na katɨ yaavo, akamwiinʉla yoomʉvɨɨka kɨpeembii, maa akavasea, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ mʉteengya musinga ja ʉhʉ sa irina raanɨ, kʉva arɨ aantéengiirye nɨɨnɨ. Na ʉra ˆmweene arɨ kʉʉnteengya nɨɨnɨ, sɨ arɨ kʉva aantéengiirye vii tʉkʉ, kei kʉva arɨ amʉtéengiirye Mʉlʉʉngʉ, na yeeye aantʉma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutumia Irina ra Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Lʉ́ka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Maa Yooháani akamʉsea, “Mukiindya, tamwɨɨ́ne mʉʉntʉ yookibirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ kwa irina raako, maa tʉkamʉkaanʼya sa viintʉ sɨ arɨ hamwɨ na suusu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, “Karɨ mʉmʉkáanʼyaa tʉkʉ. Sa kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆatʉ́mamaa myuujíisa kwa irina raanɨ, kei aanvarindʉke chaangʉ alʉʉse ʉvɨ kʉrɨ nɨɨnɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Sa sɨ ˆarɨ mʉvɨ wiitʉ, nɨ hamwɨ arɨ na suusu.<verse eid="MRK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ vaheera baa ndʉvo ya maaji yo nywa vii sa nyuunyu nɨ vaantʉ va <char style="w">Kirisitʉ</char>, kɨkomi sɨ arɨ sova kʉnáálo yaachwe tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉvahaanda Vɨɨngɨ Vabweeyye Ʉvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matáayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lʉ́ka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>Kei akavasea, “Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ amʉháandire ʉmwɨ wa ava vadúúdi ˆvaanduma atʉmame ʉvɨ, nɨ pwee yaachwe achʉʉngɨrwe lwaala nkiingwii, maa afweitɨrwe mayiyii. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Na koonɨ iyaanja raako rakʉháandire ʉtʉmame ʉvɨ, rɨteme rɨdʉmʉke. Nɨ pwee kɨɨngɨra na nkaaswii ʉrɨ na iyaanja rɨmwɨ, kʉlookya kʉdoma na mootwii wa <char style="w">Jehénamu</char> ʉra sɨ ˆurímaa, ʉrɨ na mayaanja yoosi. [<verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Ʉko noo kʉʉntʉ ngʼonyu sɨ ˆjikwíjaa na mooto sɨ ˆurímaa.]<verse eid="MRK 9:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Kei, koonɨ ijeo raako rakʉháandire ʉtʉmame ʉvɨ, rɨteme rɨdʉmʉke. Nɨ pwee kɨɨngɨra na nkaaswii ʉrɨ na ijeo rɨmwɨ, kʉlookya kʉfweitɨrwa na mootwii wa Jehénamu ʉrɨ na majeo yavɨrɨ. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Ʉko noo kʉʉntʉ ngʼonyu sɨ ˆjikwíjaa na mooto sɨ ˆurímaa.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Na koonɨ riiso raako rakʉháandire ʉtʉmame ʉvɨ, rɨnonkole. Nɨ pwee kɨɨngɨra Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ ʉrɨ na ipoócho, kʉlookya kʉfweitɨrwa na mootwii wa Jehénamu ʉrɨ na miiso yoosi. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Ʉko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">‘noo kʉʉntʉ ngʼonyu sɨ ˆjikwíjaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">na mooto sɨ ˆurímaa.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isáaya 66:24</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Voosi talariwa mʉrɨ nɨ mooto ja ˆvyeene <char style="w">mpóryo</char> jitálariwaa nɨ sangása.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:49 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">jitálariwaa nɨ sangása: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Vayahúudi sangása ɨjáa nɨ kɨɨntʉ ˆchavɨkɨrwáa kɨra chóorya. Voovo vavɨkɨráa sangása baa mpórywii ˆngʼeene vatooláa kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Kei, varumáa mpóryo jatálariwaa nɨ sangása. </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LEV 2:13">Valáawi 2:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>Sangása yabooha, maa kaa, koonɨ yasúukire che ɨrɨ vɨkɨrwa de ɨve mwerere kei? Mʉve na sangása isii yaanyu. Mwiikale mwiikalo mʉʉja, kɨra mʉʉntʉ na mwiiwaachwe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovariyʉla Kwiisiita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matáayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lʉ́ka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Hara, maa <char style="w">Yéesu</char> na vapooji vaachwe vakakwaata njɨra fuma Kaperenáumu fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ ya <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char>, vakafɨrɨra na ufumo wa mwaasʉ nyambʉko ya lʉʉjɨ lwa Yorodáani, mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ ɨkamutuuba, maa akaanda vavariyʉrɨra Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho ja ˆvyeene iijʉvɨra.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Aho, vamwɨ va <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> vakʉʉja voosaaka mʉyera Yéesu, maa vakaanda muurya, “Eri, <char style="w">Miiro</char> yaruma mʉʉntʉ kʉmʉreka muki waachwe wʉʉ?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Maa Yéesu akavuurya, “<char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> joolɨ ajáa avalairirya?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Novo vakamʉsea, “Mʉ́sa aruma mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme amwaandɨkɨre muki waachwe taláka, amusiite.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 24:1-4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Mʉ́sa avaandɨkɨra ʉlairiri ʉwo sa ʉfafu wa mɨtɨma yaanyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Maa kaa, keende ncholo yo kʉʉmbwa kwa weerʉ, ‘Mʉlʉʉngʉ ajáa avʉʉmba mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme na mʉʉntʉ muki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="GEN 1:27">Ncholo 1:27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>Sa jei, mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme avarékaa vala íyo na taáta waavo, akava kɨɨntʉ kɨmwɨ na muki waachwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>novo vavɨrɨ kʉva varɨ mʉvɨrɨ ʉmwɨ.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="GEN 2:24">Ncholo 2:24</ref>.</char></note> Jeyyo sɨ varɨ kʉva vavɨrɨ tʉkʉ, nɨ mʉvɨrɨ ʉmwɨ. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Sa jeyyo, ˆcheene akɨlʉmanʼya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, mʉʉntʉ sɨ arɨ nanʉkʉla tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi, vakɨɨngɨra kei na nyuumbii, maa vapooji vaachwe vakamuurya rɨra isáare. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Maa akavasea, “Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆarɨ musiita muki waachwe, maa aloole muki wɨɨngɨ, kʉva arɨ yooyeenda na muki wa mʉʉntʉ. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Na muki ˆarɨ musiita mʉlʉme waachwe, maa aloolwe nɨ mʉlʉme wɨɨngɨ kʉva arɨ yooyeenda na mʉlʉme wa mʉʉntʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovatalarya Vasinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matáayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lʉ́ka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Aho, vaantʉ vakaanda mʉretera vasinga vaduudi sa avatalarye. Maa kaa, vapooji vaachwe vakavaamirirya. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Yéesu ˆakoone jeyyo, akakalala, maa akavasea, “Reki kʉvakɨtɨra vasinga vaduudi, reki vʉʉje, sa <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> nɨ sa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ ja vasinga. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ dɨɨra mʉrekera Mʉlʉʉngʉ amʉlongorɨre ja musinga muduudi, sɨ arɨ kɨɨngɨra vii kaa tʉkʉ, Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Hara, maa akavakwaatɨrɨra, akavavɨkɨra mɨkono, kʉnʉ yoovatalarya.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉheewa Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matáayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lʉ́ka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Yéesu akakwaata njɨra, mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa njirii, mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ akamʉkɨbɨrɨra, akachwaama mbere yaachwe, maa akamuurya, “Mukiindya mʉʉja! Che ndɨrɨ bweeyya sa mpokere nkaasʉ ya sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Sa che wookʉʉnyanɨrɨra mʉʉja? Kusiina mʉʉja tʉkʉ, mʉʉja nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ yeemweene vii. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Wamányire ndairiri jaachwe wʉʉ? Karɨ wʉʉ́laa tʉkʉ, karɨ ʉyéendaa na muki wa mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ, karɨ wiívaa tʉkʉ, kʉlongowererya mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ, kwiiva kwa ʉkwaata tʉkʉ, baa kei ʉvanyemye vala íyo na taáta waanyu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ufumo 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 5:16-20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Maa akamʉsea, “Mukiindya, aya yoosi nayakwaatya keende usinga waanɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yéesu akamʉlaanga, akamweenda, maa akamʉsea, “Usiina kɨɨntʉ kɨmwɨ vii. Tamanya ʉkavae iyoombe máari jaako joosi vʉʉ, na mpía ˆngʼeene ʉrɨ turya ʉvaheere vakɨva, aho kʉva ʉrɨ na máari ya kɨkomi ya mberii kurumwii, maa de wuuntuube.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>ˆAkateere jeyyo, akiirya mʉtɨma, maa akalooka, sa nɨ musúngaati maatʉkʉ vii ajáa.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yéesu akalaanga kʉnʉ na kʉnʉ, maa akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Kʉva viri vyafafa maatʉkʉ vii, kwa vasúngaati kɨɨngɨra Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Hara, maa vapooji vakatʉlʉvala sa yara masáare yaachwe, maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, “Vanavaanɨ, kwɨɨngɨra na Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ kʉva viri vyafafa maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Nɨ vyaangʉ ngamɨ́a kʉtweera na ihengerii ra sinkeni, kʉlookya musúngaati kɨɨngɨra na Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<figure style="fig" alt="camel" file="hk00038c.tif" size="col" copy="The Bristish and foreign Bible society 1994" ref="10:25">Ngamɨ́a</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakatʉlʉvalatʉlʉvaala kʉnʉ vookiiyurya, “Nɨ ani de arɨ daha lamuririwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yéesu akavatuurirya miiso, maa akavasea, “Kwa vaantʉ sɨ vidáhɨkaa tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ sɨ viri jeyyo tʉkʉ. Sa viintʉ vyoosi vyadáhɨkaa kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>
    <char style="w">Peéteri</char> akaanda mʉsea, “Laanga! Suusu tareka kɨra kɨɨntʉ tʉkakutuuba.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, kɨra mʉʉntʉ ˆareka nyuumba, vandʉʉ vaachwe, marʉʉmbʉ yaachwe, vaanaavo, taáta na íyo, au baa na vasinga na mawʉnda sa nɨɨnɨ na sa <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char>, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>hokera arɨ mara igana rɨmwɨ (100) kʉlookya mpɨɨndɨ iji, nyuumba, vandʉʉ, vaanaavo, marʉʉmbʉ, vasinga, mawʉnda au baa na uturikiri, na kei weerʉ ˆyookʉʉja, hokera arɨ nkaasʉ ya sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Maa kaa, vara va ncholo veera varɨ mukirii, na vara va mukirii kʉva varɨ va ncholo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolʉʉsa Inkwya na Ʉfʉfʉ́ʉko Waachwe lwa Katatʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matáayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lʉ́ka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa njirii voodoma na Yerusaléemu, Yéesu ajáa avalóngorɨɨre vapooji vaachwe, novo vajáa vakwáatirwe nɨ woowa, na vaantʉ vara ˆvamutuubáa, voofáa. Yéesu akavasʉmʉla kei vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ na ivarwii, maa akavawyɨɨra yara ˆyarɨ mʉfʉmɨra. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>“Teereri! Haaha nɨ doma tiise na Yerusaléemu, ʉko, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> vɨɨkwa arɨ mɨkonwii ya vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char>, novo lʉʉsa varɨ irya akwye na mʉvɨɨka varɨ mɨkonwii ya vaantʉ sɨ ˆvarɨ <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char>. <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Novo mʉhenchʉla varɨ, mʉchwɨɨra varɨ matɨ noo mʉvaa na <char style="w">mɨjeléedi</char> na mʉʉlaa varɨ, maa kaa, sikʉ ya katatʉ fʉfʉlwa arɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaakúupu na Yooháani Vooloomba Ʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matáayo 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Hara, Yaakúupu na Yooháani vala sha Sebedáayo, vakɨɨta kʉrɨ Yéesu, maa vakamʉsea, “Mukiindya! Toosaaka ʉtʉtʉmamɨre kɨɨntʉ chochoosi ˆtʉrɨ loomba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Maa Yéesu akavuurya, “Che moosaaka nɨvatʉmamɨre?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Maa vakamʉsea, “Mpɨɨndɨ ˆʉrɨ kʉva mʉtemi wa vaantʉ voosi, tooloomba twiikale ʉmwɨ mʉkono waako wa kʉlʉme, na wɨɨngɨ mʉkono waako wa kʉmooso nkongojimii kwaako.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Maa Yéesu akavasea, “Sɨ mootaanga ˆcheene mooloomba tʉkʉ. De daha mʉrɨ kʉnyweera ndʉvo ya uturikiri ˆngʼeene ndɨrɨ nyweera au <char style="w" lemma="Batisa">kʉbatisiwa</char> ʉbatíiso ˆmweene ndɨrɨ batisiwa wʉʉ?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Maa vakamʉsea, “Daha tʉrɨ.” Yéesu akavasea, “Ndʉvo ˆngʼeene ndɨrɨ kɨɨnyweera, kɨmaarɨ kɨɨnyweera mʉrɨ, baa na ʉbatíiso ˆmweene ndɨrɨ batisiwa, batisiwa mʉrɨ. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Maa kaa, ani arɨ kiikala mʉkono waanɨ wa kʉlʉme au wa kʉmooso, sɨ mʉrɨmo waanɨ kʉvaheera tʉkʉ, sa nkalo ijo, heewa varɨ ˆveene viimiriwa neeja nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Vara vapooji vɨɨngɨ ikimi ˆvakateere jeyyo, maa vakavakalarɨra vala Yaakúupu na Yooháani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Hara, maa Yéesu akavaanɨrɨra vapooji vaachwe voosi, akavasea, “Mʉmányire, vatemi va vaantʉ sɨ ˆvarɨ Vayahúudi valáɨraa vatɨɨte wiimiriri mweeri ya vaantʉ na ngururu, na vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ vaavo, valáɨraa vatɨɨte wiimiriri mweeri yaavo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Kʉrɨ nyuunyu sɨ noosaaka ɨve jeyyo tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, ʉra ˆyoosaaka ave mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ waanyu, nɨ mpaka ave mʉtʉmami waanyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Na mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆyoosaaka kʉva wa ncholo, nɨ mpaka ave mʉtʉ́mwa wa voosi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Sa baa Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ, sɨ ʉʉja jo tʉmamɨrwa tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, ʉʉja sa jɨ avatʉmamɨre vaantʉ, kei atoole nkaasʉ yaachwe kʉva <char style="w">ununuuli</char> sa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉhoku Batimáayo Yoohoriwa nɨ Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matáayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lʉ́ka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Aho, vakafika múuji wa Yerɨ́ɨko. Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu, vapooji vaachwe na ɨra mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ ˆvalookáa múujii, vakamʉshaana mʉhoku ˆasewáa Batimáayo. Yeeye nɨ sha Timáayo ajáa. Na ajáa iíkyɨɨre mbarɨmbarɨ ya njɨra yooloomba. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>ˆAkateere Yéesu wa Nasaréeti yoolooka na aho, akaanda tʉla isóso yoosea, “Ee <char style="w">Sha Daúdi</char>, naanga na riiso ra wʉʉja!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vakamwaamirirya sa akirinye. Maa kaa, yeeye akadoomererya tʉlatʉʉla isóso, yoosea, “Ee Sha Daúdi, naanga na riiso ra wʉʉja Aaɨ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yéesu akɨɨma, maa akavasea, “Hoonɨ mwaaniriri.” Vakamwaanɨrɨra, voosea, “Hoonɨ ifafirirye, wiiheere mʉtɨma, yookwaanɨrɨra.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Akafweita lweénda lwaachwe na ivarwii, akafɨrɨra, maa akadoma na kʉrɨ Yéesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yéesu akamuurya, “Che woosaaka nɨkʉbweeyyiirye?” Maa akasea, “Mukiindya, noosaaka noone.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Tamanya, kuruma kwaako noo kwakʉhóniirye.” Hahara, akoona, maa akamutuuba Yéesu na ɨra njɨra ˆadomáa.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooteengiwa Yerusaléemu na Siriri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matáayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lʉ́ka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yooháani 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> na vapooji vaachwe ˆvakasengerere fika Yerusaléemu, vakafika maturii ya Besifáage na Besanía, Luulwii lwa <char style="w">Mɨseitúuni</char>.<figure style="fig" alt="olive" file="lb00087c.tif" size="col" copy="The British and foreign Bible society 1994" ref="11:1">Mʉseitúuni</figure> Hara, maa Yéesu akavatʉma vapooji vaachwe vavɨrɨ, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>akavasea, “Tamanyi fʉʉrʉ ituri ˆrɨrɨ aho mbere yaanyu, na kati ˆmookɨɨngɨra vii, koona mʉrɨ mwaana wa ndákwi sɨ ˆanavereka mʉʉntʉ, achúungirwe. Muchunguli, maa mʉmʉreete na aha. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Kaanɨ mʉʉntʉ avuúriirye, ‘Sa che moochʉngʉla mwaana wa ndákwi?’ mʉkamʉsea, ‘Mweenevyoosi yoomʉsaaka, mʉhɨndʉla arɨ haaha vii.’”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Sakaría 9:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Hara, maa vakadoma vakamʉshaana mwaana wa ndákwi achúungirwe mbarɨmbarɨ ya njɨra, mutiryaangwii. Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvamʉchʉngʉláa, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>vaantʉ ˆveene vajáa viímire aho, vakavuurya, “Sa che moomʉchʉngʉla mwaana wa ndákwi?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Maa vakuuyirya ja ˆvyeene Yéesu ajáa avaséire. Vara vaantʉ, maa vakavarekera vamʉsʉmʉle. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Vakamʉtwaarɨra Yéesu ʉwo mwaana wa ndákwi, vakaala ɨngo jaavo moongwii, maa Yéesu akaambʉka. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vakaala ɨngo jaavo njirii na vaangɨ vakaala matáampi ya mɨtɨ ˆvawúnire mawundii, voomʉnyemya Yéesu. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Vaantʉ vara ˆvatuubáa na vara ˆvajáa valóngwɨɨre, vaváa siriri, voosea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Adʉʉmbwe Mweenevyoosi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Atalariwa yeeye ˆyookʉʉja kwa irina ra <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char>.<verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Watalariwa ʉtemi ˆwookʉʉja ja wa taáta wiitʉ <char style="w">Daúdi</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Kʉdʉʉmbwe kurumu mweerimweeri.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sabúuri 118:26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yéesu akɨɨngɨra na Yerusaléemu, akawoloka fʉʉrʉ <char style="w" lemma="Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva">Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</char>, maa akɨɨta lorera kɨra kɨɨntʉ. Maa kaa, sa viintʉ kʉjáa kwaándire kwiira, akadoma na Besanía hamwɨ na vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoojuma Mʉsaambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Matáayo 21:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Lomʉtóondo yaachwe mpɨɨndɨ ˆvalookáa fuma Besanía, Yéesu akava aávirwe nɨ njala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Maa akoona mʉsaambu wa deedadeeda, akɨɨta laangɨra koonɨ arɨ turya saambu. ˆAkafike, sɨ oona saambu baa ɨmwɨ vii tʉkʉ, akashaana masaambɨ vii, sa sɨ jijáa mpɨɨndɨ ja saambu tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Hara, maa akʉʉsea ʉra mʉsaambu, “Kwaandɨra isikʉ mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi sɨ ˆakariire saambu yaako vii kaa tʉkʉ!” Na vapooji vaachwe vateeráa ayo masáare.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matáayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lʉ́ka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:12-22">Yooháani 2:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Vakafika Yerusaléemu. Yéesu akɨɨngɨra Kaayii Njija, akaanda vakibirya vaantʉ ˆveene vaváa iyoombe no wʉla ʉko waámii. Akakʉndʉla méesa ja vaantʉ ˆvawʉlanáa mpía na akakʉndʉla machuumbi ya vaantʉ ˆvaváa iyoombe njɨva.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus drives out people selling things in the Temple" file="Dn00429b.tif" size="col" copy="United Bible Societies 1989 Nairobi Kenya" ref="11:15">Yéesu yookibirya vaantʉ ˆvoovaa iyoombe viintʉ Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</figure> <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Kei, avakaanʼyáa vaantʉ kusiina kʉkwaatɨra baa na heehi ya waama wa Kaaya Njija na viintʉ vyo vaa iyoombe tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Ʉvariyulii waachwe akavasea, “Eri, Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho sɨ yalʉʉsa yoosea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">‘Nyuumba yaanɨ kaanɨrɨrwa ɨrɨ nyuumba yo mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ sa vaantʉ va ɨsɨ joosi tʉkʉ wʉʉ?’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17a </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isáaya 56:7</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">Maa kaa, nyuunyu mwɨɨválandwɨɨre ɨkava ‘mpaanga ya viívi’?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17b </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yeremía 7:11</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char>, vajáa vateera ˆmeene Yéesu ajáa alúusire. Maa vakaanda saakɨra nkalo yo mʉʉlaa. Vamoofáa, sa vaantʉ ˆvatʉlʉvariwáa nɨ ʉvariyuli waachwe, na vara ˆvayeendáa masáare yaachwe, vavijáa foo. <verse eid="MRK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>ˆƗkafike niiwʉlo, Yéesu na vapooji vakafuma Yerusaléemu vakadoma na Besanía.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉsaambu Wookʉʉma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Matáayo 21:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Lomʉtóondo namʉtóondo mpɨɨndɨ ˆvalookáa na hara, vakoona ʉra mʉsaambu washáawukire fuma miririi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/><char style="w">Peéteri</char> akʉʉkʉmbʉkɨra ʉra mʉsaambu, maa akamʉsea Yéesu, “Mukiindya! Laanga ʉra mʉsaambu ˆwaarɨ wuujumiré, washáawukire!” <verse eid="MRK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Maa Yéesu akavasea, “Murumi Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, koonɨ mʉʉntʉ aséire lʉʉlʉ ʉlʉ lwiisunke, lʉkafweitɨrwe irivii, na yeeye asiina kivundu mutimii waachwe, kɨmaarɨ kaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ mʉtʉmamɨra arɨ masáare ayo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Sa jeyyo, nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, isáare roroosi ˆmʉrɨ loomba mpɨɨndɨ ˆmoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, haaha murume mwarɨpátire isáare ɨro mitimii yaanyu, noro kʉva rɨrɨ raanyu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ kɨɨma sa mʉmʉloombe Mʉlʉʉngʉ, koonɨ ʉrɨ na kɨɨntʉ mutimii kwa mʉʉntʉ wɨɨngɨ, mʉsei ʉwo mʉʉntʉ, ‘Ʉvɨ waako wasírire,’ sa Taáta waanyu wa kurumwii, avasee baa nyuunyu, ‘Ʉvɨ waanyu wasírire.’ [<verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Maa kaa, koonɨ sɨ moovasea viivaanyu, ‘Ʉvɨ wasírire,’ baa Taáta waanyu wa kurumwii sɨ arɨ sea, ‘Ʉvɨ waanyu wasírire tʉkʉ.’”]<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoofoorimwa Lʉvɨro Lwaachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matáayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lʉ́ka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Kei vakafika Yerusaléemu. Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆayeendayeendáa waámii wa Kaaya Njija, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva, vakiindya va Miiro na vawosi vakʉʉja na kʉrɨ Yéesu, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>maa vakamuurya, “Nɨ kwa wiimiriri ʉrɨkwɨ wootʉmama aya masáare? Nɨ ani akʉheera wiimiriri ʉhʉ?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Maa akavasea, “Kuvuurya ndɨrɨ kɨɨntʉ kɨmwɨ. Koonɨ muúyiirye, naanɨ vawyɨɨra ndɨrɨ nɨ kwa wiimiriri ʉrɨkwɨ ˆnootʉmama aya masáare. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Eri, <char style="w" lemma="Batisa">ʉbatíiso</char> wa Yooháani nɨ kurumwii wafuma bakʉ kwa vaantʉ? Ngwyiiri!” <verse eid="MRK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Maa vakalʉʉsɨkanʼya voovo kwa voovo voosea, “Koonɨ taséire, ‘Wafuma kurumwii,’ kuurya arɨ, ‘Sa che de sɨ mwamuruma?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Maa kaa, koonɨ taséire, ‘Wafuma kwa vaantʉ…’” Vakoofa sa vaantʉ vajáa vamuruma Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji nɨ <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> wa Ijʉva wa kɨmáárɨ. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Maa vakasea, “Iyaʉ, sɨ tamányire tʉkʉ.” Ne akavasea, “Naanɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ vawyɨɨra nɨ kwa wiimiriri ʉrɨkwɨ nootʉmama aya tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovafwaanirirya Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va Vayahúudi na<optbreak/>Varimi Vavɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matáayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lʉ́ka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Hara, maa <char style="w">Yéesu</char> akaanda vawyɨɨra vara vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ símo iji, akavasea, “Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ajáa arɨma iwʉnda ra mɨsabíibu. Akariingirirya lʉkaande iwʉnda vʉʉ, akasiimba iduundu ro fʉʉnchɨra sabíibu so tengenesera <char style="w">diváai</char>, akajeenga kɨvaanda kɨlɨɨhɨ cho rɨndɨrɨra, maa akakojya ɨro iwʉnda raachwe kwa varimi. Hara, maa akakera njɨra.<figure style="fig" alt="vine yard" file="lb00103c.tif" size="col" copy="Knowles, The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="12:1">Iwʉnda ra mɨsabíibu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Mpɨɨndɨ jo chwa ˆjikafike, akamʉtʉma mʉtʉ́mwa waachwe, akasʉmʉle haantʉ haachwe ha sabíibu ˆngʼeene vachwíire. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Ʉra mʉtʉ́mwa ˆakafike, vara vaantʉ vakamʉkwaata, vakamʉvaa, maa vakamukibirya na mɨkono mɨtʉhʉ. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Mweeneiwʉnda akatʉma mʉtʉ́mwa wɨɨngɨ kei, ʉhʉ ne vakamʉvaa mutwii, baa kei vakamʉbweeyyirya masáare ya soni. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Mweeneiwʉnda akatʉma mʉtʉ́mwa wɨɨngɨ, ʉhʉ re, vakamʉʉlaa. Atʉma vɨɨngɨ ˆvarɨ foo, vɨɨngɨ vavaváa na vɨɨngɨ vavʉʉláa.<verse eid="MRK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Ʉhero waachwe, mweeneiwʉnda ajáa achɨ́hɨɨre na mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ vii wo tʉma, na ʉhʉ nɨ mwaana waachwe ˆamweendamweenda, akamʉtʉma yookiisea, ‘Kʉmʉnyemya varɨ mwaana waanɨ!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>ˆAkafike, maa vara ˆvakojiwa iwʉnda vakiiwyɨɨra voosea, ‘Ʉhʉ noo mʉpaari wa ɨrɨ iwʉnda. Hendi tʉmʉʉlae, maa ʉpaari waachwe ʉve wiiswi.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Hara, vakamʉkwaata, vakamʉʉlaa, maa vakɨɨta mʉwʉmɨra weerwii ya lʉkaande lwa iwʉnda ra mɨsabíibu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Maa Yéesu akavasea, “Joolɨ mookiisea mweeneiwʉnda lo ˆakabweeyyiirye? Kʉʉja arɨ, vʉʉlaa arɨ vʉʉ avo ˆavakojya, maa avakojye varimi vɨɨngɨ iwʉnda raachwe ra sabíibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Amwɨ moobweeyya ja sɨ mʉnasoma aya Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho ja ˆvyeene yalʉʉsa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Iwye ˆrasiitwa nɨ vajeengi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">ravɨ́ɨre iwye ikʉʉlʉ ra kichurii.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> atʉ́mamire isáare ɨrɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">noro rabooha, na nɨ iyeni maatʉkʉ vii miiswii yiiswi.’”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sabúuri 118:22-23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Hara, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char> vasaakáa vamʉkwaate Yéesu sa vajáa vatáangire lusímo ʉlʉ nɨ voovo lʉjáa lwavalúusire. Maa kaa, voofáa ɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ. Hara vakalamʉla vamʉreke, maa vakalooka.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉrɨha Kóodi kwa Kaisáari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matáayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lʉ́ka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi, vara vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ vakavatʉma <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> na vaantʉ ˆvafúmire kwa mʉtemi <char style="w">Heróode</char>, sa vamʉtee Yéesu, de vamʉkwaate sa masáare yaachwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Vakamʉʉjɨra, vakamʉsea, “Mukiindya! Takʉmányire weewe ʉrɨ mʉʉntʉ ˆʉlʉ́ʉsaa kɨmáárɨ, baa kei sɨ woófaa ʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ, sa weewe sɨ ʉláangaa buuwo tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, ʉváriyʉlaa njɨra ya kɨmáárɨ ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Eri, ndairiri jaruma mʉʉntʉ arɨhe kóodi kwa <char style="w">Kaisáari</char> mʉtawáala wa Rúumi bakʉ tʉkʉ? <verse eid="MRK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Joolɨ woosea, tʉrɨhe bakʉ tʉkʉ?” Maa kaa, Yéesu akataanga ʉkweembi waavo, maa akavasea, “Amwɨ mooyera kʉʉntea? Hoonɨ ndeteri mpía ya <char style="w">dináari</char> ˆngʼeene mʉrɨháa kóodi nɨɨyone.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>ˆVakareete, maa akavuurya, “Buuwo na lʉtalo ʉlʉ nɨ lwa ani?” Vakamʉsea, “Nɨ lwa Kaisáari.”<figure style="fig" alt="coin" file="hk00166c.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1954, 1967, 1972, 1995" ref="12:15">Mpía ya dináari</figure><verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Maa Yéesu akavasea, “Viintʉ vya Kaisáari, mʉheeri Kaisáari na viintʉ vya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, mʉheeri Mʉlʉʉngʉ.” Maa isáare ɨrɨ rɨkavahwaalarya maatʉkʉ vii.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ʉfʉfʉ́ʉko wa Vaantʉ ˆVawulala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matáayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lʉ́ka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Hara, vakʉʉja <char style="w">Masadukáayo</char>, vaantʉ ˆveene vaséaa kusiina kʉfʉfʉka kaanɨ mʉʉntʉ akwíire tʉkʉ. Vakamʉsea, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Mukiindya! <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> ajáa atwaandɨkɨra <char style="w">Miiro</char> Masáarii ˆYarɨ Mpeho akatʉsea, ‘Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ akwíire baa kʉva na vaana tʉkʉ, mwaanaavo yoosaakwa amʉpaale ʉwo mʉlala sa amʉvyaarɨre vaana mwaanaavo ʉra ˆaakwya.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 25:5-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Haaha, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte vaana valʉme mufungatɨ va mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ. Ʉra wa ncholo ˆakaloole, akawulala baa kʉva na mwaana tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Wa kavɨrɨ akamʉpaala mʉlala ˆarékirwe nɨ mwaanaavo, ne akawulala baa kʉva na mwaana tʉkʉ. Wa katatʉ ne vikava vivira. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Voosi mufungatɨ vakawulala baa reka vaana tʉkʉ, ʉhero waachwe, mʉlala ne akawulala. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Haaha tʉwyɨɨre, sikʉ ya ʉfʉfʉ́ʉko ʉhʉ mwaana muki nɨ muki wa ani arɨ kʉva? Sa voosi mufungatɨ vajáa vamʉloola.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Maa akuuyirya, yoosea, “Mʉhóniirye sa viintʉ sɨ mʉyamányire Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho na ngururu ja Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Vaantʉ ˆvawulala haantʉ ˆvakafufukire, kusiina kʉloola no loolwa tʉkʉ, voosi kʉva varɨ ja <char style="w">mirimʉ miija</char> ya kurumwii. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Maa kaa, kwa ʉfʉfʉ́ʉko wa vaantʉ ˆvaakwya, amwɨ mookiibweeyya ja sɨ mʉnasoma kɨtáabu cha Mʉ́sa, ˆcheene chalʉʉsa ˆvyeene Mʉlʉʉngʉ alʉʉsɨkáa na Mʉ́sa fuma ituundwii ˆreene rakoreráa mooto?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ufumo 3:6</ref>.</char></note> Mʉlʉʉngʉ amʉsea, ‘Nɨɨnɨ nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa <char style="w">Aburaháamu</char>, Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa Isaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Isaka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ mwaana wa Aburaháamu kwa Sáara muki waachwe.</char></note> na Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa Yaakúupu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kɨtáabwii cha Ufumo 3:6, Mʉlʉʉngʉ ajáa amuwyɨɨra Mʉ́sa masáare aya. Maa kaa, mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Aburaháamu, Isaka na Yaakúupu vajáa vawulala aho kalɨ vii.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Yeeye sɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa vaantʉ ˆvaakwya tʉkʉ, yeeye nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa ˆvarɨ nkaasʉ. Kati ˆmoosea kusiina ʉfʉfʉ́ʉko tʉkʉ, moohonʼya maatʉkʉ vii.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ʉlairiri Mʉkʉʉlʉ Kʉlookya Joosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matáayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lʉ́ka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Ʉmwɨ wa <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> ajáa amwaarɨ hara, yooteerera ˆvyeene Yéesu na Masadukáayo viirutáa ndihi. ˆAkateere Yéesu uúyiirye viija, maa akamuurya Yéesu, “Eri, nɨ ʉlairiri ʉrɨkwɨ noo mʉkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya ndairiri joosi?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Ʉlairiri mʉkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya joosi noo ʉhʉ, ‘Ee <char style="w" lemma="Viisiraéeli">Isiraéeli</char> teeri, <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ wiitʉ, noo Mʉlʉʉngʉ ʉmwɨ vii. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Ʉmweende <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ waako na mʉtɨma waako woosi, na nkaasʉ yaako yoosi, na mɨryʉʉngʉ yaako yoosi, na ngururu jaako joosi, noo kʉsea, kɨra kɨɨntʉ ˆʉrɨ.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 6:4-5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Na wa kavɨrɨ noo ʉhʉ, ‘Ʉmweende mwiiwaako ja ˆvyeene wiiyenda mweeneevyo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Valáawi 19:18</ref>.</char></note> Kusiina ʉlairiri wɨɨngɨ ʉrɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya ndairiri iji tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Ʉra mukiindya wa Miiro ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ akamʉsea, “Mukiindya, wuúyiirye viija, ‘Ijʉva nɨ ʉmwɨ vii na kusiina wɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Na kʉmweenda Ijʉva na mʉtɨma woosi na mɨryʉʉngʉ yoosi na ngururu joosi, na mʉʉntʉ kʉmweenda mwiiwaachwe ja ˆvyeene iiyenda yeemweene, nɨ viija kwa Ijʉva kʉlookya kʉtoola <char style="w">mpóryo</char> jo chɨmɨka joosi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yéesu ˆakateere ʉra mʉʉntʉ uúyiirye na tooti, maa akamʉsea, “Aaɨ! Weewe sɨ ʉrɨ kʉlɨ na <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> tʉkʉ.” Keende hara kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆayera muurya kɨɨntʉ chɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Masía nɨ Mweenevyoosi na nɨ Mwaana wa Daúdi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matáayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lʉ́ka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆavariyʉláa waámii wa <char style="w">Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva</char>, akuurya, “Sa che vakiindya va Miiro vaséaa <char style="w">Masía</char> nɨ Mwaana wa <char style="w">Daúdi</char>? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Daúdi mweeneevyo kwa lʉvɨro lwa <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char>, ajáa asea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘<char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> ajáa amʉsea Mweenevyoosi waanɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">“Ikala mʉkono waanɨ wa kʉlʉme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">fʉʉrʉ nɨvavɨɨke vavɨ vaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">vave ɨsɨ ya majeo yaako.”’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sabúuri 110:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Daúdi mweeneevyo yoomwaanɨrɨra ‘Mweenevyoosi’ waachwe, ha de joolɨ Masía arɨ kʉva Mwaana wa Daúdi?” Mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ɨkamʉteerera na cheerʉ.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vaantʉ Vavalaange Neeja Vakiindya va Miiro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matáayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Lʉ́ka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆavavariyʉrɨráa, akavasea, “Valaangi neeja vakiindya va Miiro, veenda kiivɨkɨra nkáancho ndɨɨhɨ na veenda luumbiwa ko nyemiwa sóokwii. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Baa kei, veenda kiikala machuumbi ya mbere ya vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">masinagóogii</char> na haantʉ ha nyemi ngovii. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Vanyáhɨraa nyuumba ja valala, na ʉkweembi vamʉlóombaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ vilɨɨhɨlɨɨhɨ. Heewa varɨ irya ikʉʉlʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpóryo ya Mʉlala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Lʉ́ka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Aho, Yéesu akiikala heehi na isandúku ro vɨkɨra mpóryo ja Kaaya Njija, akava yoolaanga ˆvyeene vaantʉ vootoola mpóryo. Vasúngaati ˆvarɨ foo vakavɨkɨra mpía ˆjiri foo. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Hara, maa akʉʉja mʉlala ʉmwɨ akatoola fipóocho fivɨrɨ fiduudi.<verse eid="MRK 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Yéesu, akavaanɨrɨra vapooji vaachwe, akavasea, “Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, ʉhʉ mʉlala mʉkɨva atwɨ́ɨre mpóryo nkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya vaantʉ voosi vʉʉ! <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Ava vaangɨ vatwɨ́ɨre máari ˆɨlóokerɨɨre. Maa kaa, noovawyɨɨra ʉhʉ mʉlala na ʉkɨva waachwe atwɨ́ɨre choosi ˆatɨɨte.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kʉvawa kwa Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matáayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lʉ́ka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ˆafumáa <char style="w" lemma="Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva">Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</char>, ʉmwɨ wa vapooji vaachwe akamʉsea, “Mukiindya! Laanga, majuumba aya viintʉ ˆyabooha na mawye yaachwe viintʉ ˆyakʉla.” <verse eid="MRK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Koona wiise majuumba yoosi aya wʉʉ? Kusiina iwye ˆrɨkachɨ́hɨɨre mweeri ya iwye rɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ, yoosi luu girimʉlwa yarɨ vʉʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uturikiri ˆWookʉʉja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matáayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lʉ́ka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi Yéesu ajáa adoma fʉʉrʉ Luulwii lwa <char style="w">Mɨseitúuni</char>. Akiikala kʉnʉ aléyyiirye miiso na Kaayii Njija. Vapooji vaachwe, <char style="w">Peéteri</char>, Yaakúupu, Yooháani na Anderéa vakamuurya mpoolɨ, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Aaɨ tʉwyɨɨre, masáare aya nɨ naadi ˆyarɨ fʉmɨra? Na nɨ isháara che ˆtʉrɨ koona de tʉtaange masáare aya yaséngerɨɨre?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Maa akavasea, “Laangi neeja, karɨ mʉʉntʉ avakoovere tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Sa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo kʉʉja varɨ kwa irina raanɨ, kɨra mʉʉntʉ yoosea, ‘Nɨɨnɨ noo yeeye,’ novo vakoovera varɨ vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>ˆMʉkateɨɨre masáare ya nkoondo na fweefwee ja nkoondo, karɨ moófaa tʉkʉ. Masáare aya nɨ mpaka yafʉmɨre, maa kaa, ʉra ʉhero ʉkaarɨ. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Ɨsɨ kiinʉla ɨrɨ nkoondo na ɨsɨ yɨɨngɨ, na ʉtemi kiinʉla ʉrɨ nkoondo na ʉtemi wɨɨngɨ. Kʉva kʉrɨ na vitiíntima haantʉ haantʉ, baa kei, kʉva kʉrɨ na njala ya imalo. Ɨyo noo ja ncholo vii ya ʉsʉʉngʉ wa makata ˆvyeene waándaa.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>Maa kaa, nyuunyu laangi neeja, twaalwa mweende na balásii na lamʉrɨrwa mweende mʉvawe <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">masinagóogii</char>. Baa kei, twaalwa mweende kwa magávana na kwa vatemi sa nɨɨnɨ, aho, de mʉdahe variyʉla vataange kɨmaarɨ. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Maa kaa, de ʉra ʉhero ufike, nɨ mpaka ta <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> yavariyʉlwe ɨsɨ joosi vʉʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Na ˆmʉrɨ kwaatwa no twaalwa na balásii, karɨ mwiítweetyaa che ˆmʉrɨ lʉʉsa tʉkʉ. Luusi isáare roroosi ˆrɨrɨ vʉʉjɨra mpɨɨndɨ jiijo, sa masáare ˆmʉrɨ lʉʉsa sɨ yaanyu tʉkʉ, nɨ ya <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char>. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Mʉʉntʉ mʉvarindʉka arɨ mwaanaavo sa ʉʉlawe, taáta mʉvarindʉka arɨ mwaana waachwe sa ʉʉlawe. Vaana novo vavarindʉka varɨ vala íyo na taáta waavo sa vʉʉlawe. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Sʉʉlwa mʉrɨ nɨ vaantʉ voosi sa irina raanɨ. Maa kaa, ˆmweene arɨ yimirirya fʉʉrʉ ʉhero, ʉwo noo arɨ lamuririwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irema Ikʉʉlʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matáayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lʉ́ka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>Haantʉ ˆmʉkɨɨ́ne, ‘ʉnyanyi ˆʉréetaa ʉsaambʉ ˆwavɨɨhavɨɨha’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Danyéeli 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref>.</char></note> wiímire Haantʉ Haaja sɨ ˆharɨ haachwe haachwe, mʉʉntʉ yoosoma ataange, vara ˆvarɨ ɨsɨ ya <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char> vatɨjɨre njuulwii. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ ikekeerii karɨ akiime ɨɨngɨre na nyuumbii jɨ atoole kɨɨntʉ chochoosi tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Ʉra ˆarɨ iwundii atɨɨje chaangʉ, karɨ ahɨndʉke na kaayii jɨ atoole nkáancho yaachwe tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Nɨ mpolaɨ kwa vara ˆvarɨ kʉva varuto na vara ˆvɨɨndookoonkya sikʉ ijo. <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Loombi sa ɨro rɨsɨfʉmɨre mpɨɨndɨ ja mpeho tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Sa sikʉ ijo, kʉva kʉrɨ na uturikiri mʉkʉʉlʉ ˆmweene sɨ ʉnafʉmɨra keende Mʉlʉʉngʉ ʉʉmba weerʉ fʉʉrʉ isikʉ, baa sɨ luu ʉkafʉmɨɨre kei vii kaa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Na ngaarɨ Ijʉva sɨ akéehyaa sikʉ ijo, ngaarɨ kusiina mʉʉntʉ baa ʉmwɨ ˆahona vii kaa tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, sa vaantʉ ˆveene avasaawʉla, ajikeehya sikʉ ijo.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ijo koonɨ mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi avaséire, ‘La! <char style="w">Masía</char> nʉ aha’ au ‘La, amwaarɨ kʉʉra,’ karɨ murúmaa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Sa fʉmɨra varɨ vala masía va ʉloongo na <char style="w">valáali na mʉtwe</char> va ʉloongo, bweeyya varɨ isháara na viintʉ ˆvihwáalaryaa sa vavakoovere baa vara ˆvasaawʉlwa nɨ Ijʉva koonɨ viri dahɨka. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Maa kaa, nyuunyu mwɨɨme neeja. Navawyɨ́ɨrɨɨre masáare kati ˆyakaarɨ fʉmɨra.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉʉja kwa Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matáayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lʉ́ka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>Maa kaa, sikʉ ijo, uturikiri ʉwo ˆʉrɨ looka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">‘mwaasʉ kʉnɨkɨrɨrwa ʉrɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">na mweeri sɨ ʉrɨ fala tʉkʉ.<verse eid="MRK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>Nyényeeri wya jeende fuma kurumwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">na ngururu ja kurumu sɨngɨsɨka jeende.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isáaya 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ijo, kɨra mʉʉntʉ kʉmoona arɨ <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> yookʉʉja machwii na ngururu ˆjiri foo na nkongojima.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Danyéeli 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Wiivariyuli 1:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Maa de atʉme <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ miija">mirimʉ yaachwe miija</char> jɨ ɨvasaankanʼye na ɨvareete kwaachwe ˆveene avasaawʉla, fuma mavaru yoosi ya weerʉ, fuma utulo waasɨ, fʉʉrʉ utulo wa kurumu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉsaambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matáayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lʉ́ka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>Ikiindyi fuma kwa mʉsaambu. Matáampi yaachwe koonɨ yavɨ́ɨre na nchúundo na yaándire tʉrɨka, mwatáangaa mpɨɨndɨ ja irʉtɨra jaséngerɨɨre. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Jeyyo baa nyuunyu, ˆmʉrɨ koona ivi vyoosi, taangi jira mpɨɨndɨ jafíkire aha mʉryaangwii. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, mbyaala ɨhɨ sɨ ɨrɨ looka tʉkʉ kende masáare aya yoosi sɨ yanafʉmɨra. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Kurumu na weerʉ looka jiri, maa kaa, masáare yaanɨ sɨ yarɨ looka vii kaa tʉkʉ.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusiina ˆAmányire Sikʉ na Mpɨɨndɨ ˆArɨ Kʉʉja Yéesu Tʉkʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matáayo 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>Maa kaa, kusiina ˆamányire sikʉ ɨyo baa sáa ɨyo tʉkʉ, baa mirimʉ miija ya kurumwii na Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ, ˆmweene amányire nɨ Taáta yeemweene. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Mwɨɨme neeja na mʉndoolaanga neeja! Sɨ mʉmányire mpɨɨndɨ ijo nɨ naadi ˆjiri fika tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Valʉka viri nɨ ja mʉʉntʉ ˆyookwaata njɨra, avarékeraa vatʉ́mwa vaachwe wiimiriri, kɨra mʉʉntʉ na mʉrɨmo waachwe. Aho, maa akamʉsea mʉlangiriri wa mʉryaangwii alaange neeja. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Sa jeyyo, mwɨɨme neeja mpɨɨndɨ joosi sa sɨ mʉmányire nɨ naadi mweenenyuumba ˆarɨ hɨndʉka tʉkʉ, sa ifaanaa akahɨndʉka niiwʉlo, au nuuchikʉ, au nuuchikʉ katɨ, au namuyiingʉ, au namʉtóondo uchikʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Kaanɨ avúndukiirye kʉʉja, jɨ avashaane sɨ mʉlɨ́ɨre tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Na ɨkɨ ˆcheene noovawyɨɨra, nɨ vawyɨɨra niise vaantʉ voosi, mwɨɨme neeja.”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Mʉryʉʉngʉ wo Mʉʉlaa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matáayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lʉ́ka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yooháani 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Jijáa jachɨ́hɨɨre sikʉ ivɨrɨ vii, de ɨve <char style="w">ngovi ya Paásika</char> na <char style="w">ngovi ya mɨkáate sɨ ˆɨvɨ́kɨrwaa ʉsasɨ</char>. Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> vasaakɨráa njɨra ya iyasi yo mʉkwaata <char style="w">Yéesu</char> sa vamʉʉlae. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Vakalamʉla, voosea, “Karɨ tʉrɨbweeyye ɨrɨ isáare mpɨɨndɨ ja ɨhɨ ngovi tʉkʉ, sa vaantʉ kʉreeta ntiribʉka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoohakwa Makuta ˆYanyʉkɨra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matáayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yooháani 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Yéesu nɨ iturii ra Besanía ajáa, kaayii kwa Simóoni ˆmweene asewáa ˆarɨ na <char style="w">ʉlóónda</char>. Na mpɨɨndɨ ˆvarijáa, mʉʉntʉ muki ʉmwɨ akɨɨngɨra aho nyuumbii ˆarɨ na chʉ́pa nduudi ya iwye ˆrasongolwa, ˆɨrɨ na makuta ˆyanyʉ́kɨraa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">makuta ˆyanyʉ́kɨraa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ isáare ra Kɨgiríki, makuta aya nɨ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nárdo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yasewáa.</char></note> ya iyoombe ikʉlʉkʉʉlʉ. Akiiwʉna nkiingo ɨra chʉ́pa, maa akamwɨɨtɨra Yéesu yara makuta mutwii, yoomʉnyemya. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Vaantʉ vamwɨ vara ˆvajáa aho ˆvakoone jeyyo, vakakalala maatʉkʉ vii, vakaanda kiiwyɨɨra, “Sa che kʉbwɨɨtɨra makuta ja ayo jei? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Jangaarɨ yaváirwe iyoombe jɨtooreke mpía ja <char style="w">dináari</char> magana yatatʉ (300), maa mpía ijo vaheewe vakɨva?” Maa vakamwaamirirya ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, “Mʉreki! Sa che moomujuuwa? Aantʉ́mamɨɨre vyabooha. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Laangi! Vakɨva novo mʉrɨ mpɨɨndɨ joosi, ifaanaa mʉkavaambirirya mpɨɨndɨ yoyoosi ˆmʉrɨ keenda. Maa kaa, nɨɨnɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ kʉva na nyuunyu mpɨɨndɨ joosi tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ muki atʉ́mamire ˆcheene adáhire. Aampákire makuta kʉʉvɨka mʉvɨrɨ waanɨ neeja so taahwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, haantʉ hohoosi aha weerwii <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> ˆyarɨ variyʉlwa, ɨkɨ ˆcheene akɨtʉ́mamire ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ muki lʉʉswa kɨrɨ ja nkʉmbʉkɨra yaachwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yʉ́ʉda Yoolamʉla Kʉmʉvalandʉka Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matáayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lʉ́ka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Aho, Yʉ́ʉda Isikarióoti, ʉmwɨ wa vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ, akadoma noo mʉvarindʉka Yéesu kwa vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva ˆvakateere rɨra isáare, maa vakavyeenda maatʉkʉ vii. Vakiichuunga kwaachwe kʉmʉrɨha mpía. Aho, Yʉ́ʉda akaanda saakɨra nkalo ˆyabooha sa amʉvarindʉke Yéesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwiimya Neeja Ngovi ya Paásika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matáayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Lʉ́ka 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yooháani 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Na sikʉ ya ncholo ya ngovi ya mɨkáate sɨ ˆɨvɨ́kɨrwaa ʉsasɨ, vapooji vakamuurya Yéesu, “Hai ko wookeenda tukwiimirye neeja chóorya cha Paásika?” Sikʉ ɨyo, nɨ tʉʉva ɨjáa kwa <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char> kʉsɨɨnja muundi ˆɨrɨ mpeho sa Paásika.<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Maa Yéesu akavatʉma vapooji vaachwe vavɨrɨ, akavasea, “Domi na múujii Yerusaléemu, ʉko lʉmana mʉrɨ na mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme ˆiitíikire sʉvɨya ya maaji. Mutuubi, <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>na nyuumba ˆngʼeene arɨ kɨɨngɨra, muuryi mweenekaaya, mʉkamʉsea, ‘Mukiindya yookuurya, “Hai kɨrɨ chúumba cha vayeni kʉʉntʉ ˆndɨrɨ rɨɨra chóorya cha Paásika na vapooji vaanɨ?”’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Ʉwo mweenekaaya valaɨra arɨ chúumba kɨkʉʉlʉ ˆkɨrɨ gorófii, kwavɨɨkwa viintʉ vyoosi neeja. Imyi neeja Paásika haaho.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Maa reerʉ, vara vapooji vavɨrɨ vakiinʉka, vakadoma na múujii. ˆVakafike múujii, vakashaana kɨra kɨɨntʉ ja ˆvyeene Yéesu ajáa avawyɨ́ɨrɨɨre. Maa vakiimya neeja chóorya cha Paásika.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 12:3-11">Ufumo 12:3-11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Iwʉlo ˆrɨkɨɨngɨre, Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ vakɨɨngɨra. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa méesii voorya, Yéesu akavasea, “Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, ʉmwɨ waanyu kʉʉnvarindʉka arɨ.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sabúuri 41:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Vapooji vaachwe ˆvakateere jei, maa vakavisʉʉla, vakamʉsea ʉmwɨ ʉmwɨ, “Sɨ viri kʉva nɨ nɨɨnɨ tʉkʉ?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Maa akavasea, “Nɨ ʉmwɨ wa vapooji vaanɨ ikimi na vavɨrɨ, ˆyooriirya mʉkáate luumbwii na nɨɨnɨ aha. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/><char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> nɨ mpaka atamanye no kʉʉlawa, ja ˆvyeene vyaandɨkwa Masáarii ˆYarɨ Mpeho. Maa kaa, nɨ mpolaɨ kwa mʉʉntʉ ʉra ˆarɨ mʉvarindʉka! Nɨ pwee vijáa ngaarɨ baa sɨ avyaalwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉvɨrɨ na Sakami ya Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matáayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lʉ́ka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1 Vakoríinto 11:23-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvarijáa, Yéesu akatoola mʉkáate, akamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, akʉʉbendʉlabendʉla, maa akavaheera vapooji vaachwe, akavasea, “Tooli, ʉhʉ nɨ mʉvɨrɨ waanɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Maa akatoola kɨkóombe cha <char style="w">diváai</char>, akamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, akavaheera voosi vakanywa aho nduvwii. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Maa akavawyɨɨra, yoosea, “Ɨhɨ nɨ sakami yaanɨ ya <char style="w">mʉháko</char> ˆɨrɨ kiitwa sa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 24:8">Ufumo 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yeremía 31:31-34</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, luu sɨ nkanywiire kei diváai tʉkʉ, mpaka sikʉ ˆngʼeene nkɨɨnywiire ufya ʉko <char style="w" lemma="Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ">Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>ˆVakɨɨmbe lwɨɨ́mbo, vakalooka na Luulwii lwa <char style="w">Mɨseitúuni</char>.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolʉʉsa Peéteri Sea Arɨ sɨ Amʉmányire Tʉkʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matáayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lʉ́ka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yooháani 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yéesu akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Nyuunyu voosi kʉʉndeka mʉrɨ nɨɨmweene ja ˆvyeene vyaandɨkwa Masáarii ˆYarɨ Mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Kʉmʉvaa ndɨrɨ muríisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">na muundi jaachwe joosi kiipasa jiri.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Sakaría 13:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Maa kaa, ˆndɨrɨ fʉfʉka, valongorera ndɨrɨ na ɨsɨ ya <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>
    <char style="w">Peéteri</char> akamʉsea, “Baa vakʉtɨɨje voosi vʉʉ, nɨɨnɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ kʉreka tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Kɨmaarɨ kaa nookuwyɨɨra, uchikʉ wo wʉʉ, nkʉkʉlʉme sɨ ɨnavɨɨka lwa kavɨrɨ, lʉʉsa ʉrɨ sɨ waamányire tʉkʉ katatʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Maa Peéteri akuumirirya, yoosea, “Tʉkʉ! Baa koonɨ nɨ kukwya, nkwye na weewe, nɨɨnɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ sea sɨ nakʉmányire tʉkʉ!” Baa vapooji voosi vakalʉʉsa vivira.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ Luulwii lwa Mɨseitúuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matáayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lʉ́ka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Maa vakafika iwundii ra Getisemáane, Luulwii lwa Mɨseitúuni. Yéesu akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Ikali aha mpɨɨndɨ nɨɨnɨ ˆnookoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Akavasʉmʉla Peéteri, Yaakúupu na Yooháani hamwɨ ne. Aho, mʉtɨma waachwe ʉkafɨrɨra, kʉnʉ yookiiteera ʉsʉʉngʉ mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>akavasea, “Mʉtɨma waanɨ wookaava kende nkwye. Ikali aha, mʉkeeshe chɨrɨrɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Akaseesa na mbere kiduudi, akalaala ɨsɨ na ɨnda, maa akaanda mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, koonɨ viri dahɨka mpɨɨndɨ ya uturikiri waachwe ɨmʉnehe, <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>akasea, “Áaba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Áaba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ isáare ra Kɨaráamu, noo kʉsea </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Taáta</char><char style="ft" closed="false">.</char></note> Taáta, yoosi kwaako yadahɨkáa. Nookʉloomba nseyyirya kɨkóombe ɨkɨ cha uturikiri. Maa kaa, sɨ ja ˆvyeene nɨɨnɨ noosaaka tʉkʉ, ɨve ja ˆvyeene weewe ʉrɨ saaka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>ˆAkahɨndʉke kwa vara vapooji vaachwe vatatʉ, akavashaana vanyéyyiirye, akamwaanɨrɨra Peéteri, “Simóoni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ irina rɨɨngɨ Peéteri. Laanga </char><char style="bdit">Peéteri</char> Ʉtamanulii wa Masáare na Kɨlaangi.</note> ʉnyéyyiirye wʉʉ? Usíindirwe keesha baa isaa rimudu vii? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Arumi, mʉkeeshe no loomba sa karɨ jɨ mwɨɨngɨre mʉtehwii tʉkʉ. Mʉtɨma wɨɨ́mɨre neeja kʉtʉmama wʉʉja, maa kaa, wasíindwaa sa mʉvɨrɨ usiina ngururu tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Akadoma noo loomba kei, akalʉʉsa masáare yayara. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Kei ˆakahɨndʉke, akavashaana valɨ́ɨre, miiso yaavo yajáa yarútahire nɨ tʉlo. Vakakwaatwa nɨ soni, vakasiindwa cho muuyirya.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>ˆAkahɨndʉke lwa katatʉ, akavawyɨɨra, yoosea, “Nyuunyu mʉkaarɨ mʉlɨ́ɨre no hʉmʉlʉka wʉʉ? Laangi, mpɨɨndɨ jafíkire, Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ veera iise mɨkonwii ya vavɨ. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Inuki, hendi tʉlooke! Laangi ʉra mʉvarinduki waanɨ afíkire.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovarindʉkwa na Yookwaatwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matáayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lʉ́ka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yooháani 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆajáa akaarɨ yoolʉʉsɨka na vapooji vaachwe, Yʉ́ʉda, ʉmwɨ wa vara ikimi na vavɨrɨ, akafika na mpuka ˆɨrɨ na nyaasʉka na mpʉʉlo. Mpuka ɨyo ɨjáa yatúmirwe nɨ vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva, vakiindya va Miiro na vawosi. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Haaha, Yʉ́ʉda ʉra mʉvarinduki, ajáa ahʉ́mwɨɨre valaɨra isháara yoosea, “Ʉra ˆndɨrɨ mʉsʉndɨra ja noomuluumbya noo yeeye. Mʉkwaati, mʉmʉsʉmʉle, aveere mɨkonwii yaanyu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Yʉ́ʉda akahʉlʉlʉka na kʉrɨ Yéesu, akamuluumbya, “Mukiindya!” Maa akamʉsʉndɨra. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Ɨra mpuka ɨkamʉkwaata Yéesu, maa vakamʉvɨɨka mɨkonwii yaavo. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Aho, ʉmwɨ wa vara ˆvajáa na Yéesu akakʉʉla nyaasʉka njatwii, akamʉtema kutu dúú mʉtʉ́mwa wa <char style="w" lemma="Veeneɨsɨ">mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ</char>!<verse eid="MRK 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ mʉhóki vaantʉ viintʉ muújire no kʉʉnkwaata na nyaasʉka na nkusi wʉʉ? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Sikʉ joosi nɨjáa na nyuunyu noovariyʉla waámii wa <char style="w">Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva</char>. Amwɨ sɨ mwaankwaatáa kʉra? Haaha vyavɨ́ɨre sa Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yakiimane.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Sakaría 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27">Maáriki 14:27</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Aho, vapooji voosi vakoofa maatʉkʉ vii, vakamʉtɨɨja, maa vakamʉreka yeemweene. <verse eid="MRK 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Kwajáa kwatɨɨte mʉtavana ʉmwɨ ˆamutuubáa Yéesu, ajáa iiwɨ́ɨkɨɨre lweénda lwa <char style="w">kɨtáani</char> vii. Ɨra mpuka ˆɨkayere kʉmʉkwaata, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>akavahonyoka, akareka lweénda lwaachwe lwa kɨtáani mɨkonwii yaavo, maa akatɨɨja na kɨsava mwaarya.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolamʉrɨrwa Mbere ya Balása Nkʉʉlʉ ya Vayahúudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matáayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lʉ́ka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yooháani 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Hara, vakamʉtwaala Yéesu na kwa mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ. Maa vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva, vawosi, na vakiindya va Miiro, vakalʉmana hamwɨ. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Peéteri ne ajáa amutúubire Yéesu kwa kʉlɨ, akɨɨngɨra waámii kwa mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ, maa akiikala na valʉkalʉka yookoota mooto.<verse eid="MRK 14:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva na <char style="w">Balása Nkʉʉlʉ</char> yoosi, vasaakɨráa ʉshahíidi fuma kwa vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ, sa vamusitaakye Yéesu de vamʉʉlae. Maa kaa, sɨ vaturya kɨɨntʉ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Na vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vatooláa ʉshahíidi wa ʉloongo, maa kaa, ʉshahíidi waavo sɨ wiifwaana baa kiduudi vii tʉkʉ. <verse eid="MRK 14:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Aho, vɨɨngɨ vakɨɨma, vakamʉlongowererya voosea, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Tamʉteera yoosea, atɨ, ‘Nɨɨnɨ girimʉla ndɨrɨ ɨhɨ Kaaya Njija<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:58 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaaya Njija: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaaya Njija ˆngʼeene Yéesu alʉʉsáa aha nɨ mʉvɨrɨ waachwe. Kʉbomola no kɨɨjeenga kei kwa sikʉ itatʉ yoonekya kukwya no fʉfʉka kwaachwe.</char></note> ˆyajeengwa nɨ vaantʉ, maa de njeenge yɨɨngɨ kwa sikʉ itatʉ vii. Maa kaa, ɨyo sɨ ɨrɨ jeengwa nɨ vaantʉ tʉkʉ.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Baa jeyyo ʉshahíidi waavo ukiitaa.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Maa akɨɨma mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ mbere ya Balása Nkʉʉlʉ, akamuurya Yéesu, “Eri, sɨ wookuuyirya kɨɨntʉ chochoosi tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Aya masáare ava vaantʉ ˆvookusitaakya nɨ kɨɨntʉ che?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akakirinya sawu baa kuuyirya tʉkʉ. Hara mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ akamuurya kei, “Weewe noo <char style="w">Masía</char>, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> ˆAtalariwa wʉʉ?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yéesu akasea, “Hɨɨ, noo nɨɨnɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:62">Luu kʉmoona mʉrɨ Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:62">iíkyɨɨre mʉkono wa kʉlʉme wa Mweenengururu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:62">yookʉʉja mweeri ya machu ya kurumwii.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Danyéeli 7:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ ˆakateere jei, maa akamoola ɨngo yaachwe na nkalari, yoosea, “Mashahíidi va che kei? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Mʉʉtéɨɨre uhiintiki waachwe! Haaha nɨ joolɨ moosea?” Voosi vakalʉʉsa irya voosea, “Ʉhʉ, inkwya noo kɨɨntʉ ˆkɨmʉtéire!”<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Vaangɨ vaavo vakaanda kʉmʉchwɨɨra matɨ, vakamuchuunga ntaamɨ miiswii, vakamʉvaa ngúumi, de vandoomʉhenchʉla, “Lʉʉsa, nɨ ani akʉváire?” Baa valʉkalʉka va aho ˆvakamʉhokerere, vakamʉhapʉla makóofi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peéteri Yoosea sɨ Amʉmányire Yéesu Tʉkʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matáayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lʉ́ka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yooháani 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo joosi, Peéteri ajáa akaarɨ waámii, maa akʉʉja muhíínja ʉmwɨ wa vatʉ́mwa va mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>ˆAkamoone Peéteri yookoota mooto, akamutuurirya miiso, kʉnʉ yoosea, “Baa weewe nɨ hamwɨ waarɨ na ʉhʉ Yéesu wa Nasaréeti!”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Peéteri akasiita, yoosea, “Sɨ mányire na sɨ nootaanga ˆcheene woolʉʉsa tʉkʉ.” Maa akiinʉka, akɨtookɨɨma mutiryaangwii. Hara nkʉkʉlʉme ɨkavɨɨka.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Ʉra mʉtʉ́mwa ˆakamoone Peéteri, akavasea kei vara vaantʉ ˆvajáa viímire ne aho, “Ʉhʉ ne nɨ ʉmwɨ waavo!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Peéteri akasiita kei gɨgɨrɨ. Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi ˆɨkalooke, vara vaantʉ ˆvajáa viímire ne aho, vakamʉsea Peéteri, “Kɨmaarɨ, weewe ʉrɨ ʉmwɨ waavo, sa ʉrɨ Mʉgaliláaya weewe hamwɨ na ava!”<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Peéteri akaanda kiijuma no kiilaha yoosea, “Sɨ namʉmányire ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ ˆmoolʉʉsa tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Hahara, maa nkʉkʉlʉme ɨkavɨɨka lwa kavɨrɨ. Maa Peéteri akakʉmbʉkɨra rɨra isáare ˆaarɨ awyɨ́ɨrɨɨrwe nɨ Yéesu, “Nkʉkʉlʉme sɨ ɨnavɨɨka lwa kavɨrɨ, sea ʉrɨ sɨ waamányire tʉkʉ katatʉ.” Aho, akaanda kiita miísoori nɨ ʉsʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookiimiwa Mbere ya Gávana Piláato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matáayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lʉ́ka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yooháani 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Maa reerʉ, kʉkamwaa. Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva, vawosi, na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> na <char style="w">Balása Nkʉʉlʉ</char> yoosi ya <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char>, vakiirʉmɨra ˆvyeene varɨ mʉbweeyya <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. Vakamuchuunga pɨɨ́ngʉ, maa vakamʉtwaala na mbere ya gávana <char style="w">Piláato</char>.<verse eid="MRK 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Piláato ˆakateere masáare yaavo, maa akamuurya Yéesu, “Weewe ʉrɨ mʉtemi wa Vayahúudi wʉʉ?” Ne akuuyirya, yoosea, “Weewe ulúusire.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva vakamusitaakya Yéesu masáare ˆyarɨ foo. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Aho, Piláato akamuurya kei, “Sa che sɨ wookuuyirya? Laanga nɨ masáare yangaɨ vookusitaakya!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akakirinya sawu, baa kuuyirya tʉkʉ. Sa jeyyo, Piláato akatʉlʉvala.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooheewa Irya ro Kʉʉlawa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matáayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lʉ́ka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-40">Yooháani 18:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ja <char style="w">ngovi ya Paásika</char>, Piláato ajáa iijʉvɨra kʉmʉchʉngʉrɨra mufúungwa ʉmwɨ, ˆmweene vaantʉ varɨ loomba arekerwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Kwajáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Baráaba, ˆajáa achuungwa mʉnyololwii na vavarinduki va wiimiriri wa Kɨrúumi vɨɨngɨ. Na mpɨɨndɨ ja ʉvarinduki, yeeye na vavarinduki vajáa vʉʉlaa vaantʉ. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Aho, vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vakadoma kʉrɨ Piláato, vakamʉloomba amʉchʉngʉrɨre mufúungwa ʉmwɨ ja ˆvyeene iijʉvɨra mpɨɨndɨ ja Paásika.<verse eid="MRK 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Piláato akavuurya, “Saaka mwiise nɨmʉchʉngʉrɨre mʉtemi wa Vayahúudi wʉʉ?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Avuurya jei, sa ajáa ataanga vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva vajáa vamʉreeta Yéesu na kwaachwe, sa vamooneráa kɨvɨna.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva vakavasoonka vaantʉ, vamʉloombe Piláato amʉchʉngʉrɨre Baráaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Piláato akavuurya kei, “Ha de che moosaaka nɨmʉbweeyye ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ nyuunyu ˆmʉmʉséaa, ‘mʉtemi wa Vayahúudi’?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Vaantʉ vakatʉla isóso, voosea, “Aningʼiniwe <char style="w" lemma="Mʉsaláaba">mʉsaláabii</char> fʉʉrʉ akwye!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Piláato akavuurya, “Sa che? Ʉvɨ che abwéeyyiirye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Maa voovo vakatʉlatʉʉla isóso, voosea, “Aningʼiniwe mʉsaláabii fʉʉrʉ akwye!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Sa viintʉ Piláato asaakáa veerya mɨtɨma Vayahúudi, akavafumirya Baráaba mʉnyololwii. Akavakwaatya valwi nkoondo vamʉvae Yéesu <char style="w">mɨjeléedi</char> na vamuningʼinʼye mʉsaláabii fʉʉrʉ akwye.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Valwi Nkoondo Voomʉhena Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matáayo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yooháani 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Hara, valwi nkoondo vakamʉtwaala Yéesu na balásii ya ijuumbii ra kɨtemi ra gávana Piláato ˆrɨséwaa “Pʉratoría.” Vakasaankanʼya mpuka yoosi ya valwi nkoondo. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Vakamʉvɨkɨra Yéesu ɨngo ya kɨtemi ˆɨrɨ gyaa. Vakafota kɨsasaavo cha miíwa, vakamʉvɨkɨra mutwii.<figure style="fig" alt="crown of thorns" file="GT00101.tif" size="col" copy="Gordon Thompson, Wycliffe Bible Translators 2012" ref="15:17">Kɨsasaavo cha miíwa</figure> <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Maa vakaanda muluumbya na heenchʉ, “Lamʉkyaade ee aaɨ, mʉtemi wa Vayahúudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Vakatuuba mʉvaa na isaanga mutwii no mʉchwɨɨra matɨ. Vakamʉhena voochwaama ja vaantʉ ˆvoomʉnyemya mʉtemi. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>ˆVakahʉmʉle mʉhena, vakamufumya ɨra ɨngo ˆɨrɨ gyaa, maa vakamʉvɨkɨra ɨngo jaachwe. Aho, vakamufumya na weerwii sa vakamuningʼinʼye mʉsaláabii fʉʉrʉ akwye.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooningʼiniwa Mʉsaláabii Fʉʉrʉ Akwye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matáayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lʉ́ka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yooháani 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, valwi nkoondo vakalʉmana na mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ njirii ˆasewáa Simóoni fuma Kɨréene,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kɨréene: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ʉhʉ nɨ múuji ˆʉjáa kʉra Afɨrɨka kaskasíini, sikʉ iji ɨséwaa ɨsɨ ya Líbia. Ʉko Vayahúudi ˆvarɨ foo viikaláa, baa Simóoni nɨ ʉmwɨ wa Vayahúudi ˆveene vʉʉjáa na Yerusaléemu na ngovii ya Paásika.</char></note> taáta waala Alekɨsáanda na Rufáasi. Ɨɨngɨráa na Yerusaléemu, maa vakamʉdoomererya avaale mʉsaláaba wa Yéesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Vakamʉtwaala Yéesu fʉʉrʉ haantʉ ˆkʉséwaa Goligóota, noo kʉsea, “Kɨsááya cha Mʉtwe.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Vakamʉheera <char style="w">diváai</char> ˆyasaangiwa na mooda ˆʉséwaa manemáane,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">manemáane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ mooda ˆʉsáangiwaa na diváai so seyya makuundi.</char></note> anywe, maa kaa, yeeye akasiita. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Vakamuningʼinʼya mʉsaláabii. Maa vakiigavɨra ɨngo jaachwe ko jivaɨra mbare sa vataange ani aheewe ɨrɨkwɨ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sabúuri 22:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvamuningʼinʼyáa mʉsaláabii, ɨjáa nɨ namʉtóondo mpɨɨndɨ jo yʉʉrɨra ngʼoombe. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Mweeri ya mʉtwe waachwe vakavaɨrɨra ibambari ˆraandɨkwa kɨloongi chaachwe, “<char style="sc">Mʉtemi wa Vayahúudi</char>.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Viívi vavɨrɨ vakaningʼiniwa mʉsaláabii ne, kɨra mʉʉntʉ mʉsaláabii waachwe, ʉmwɨ ivaru ra kʉlʉme na wɨɨngɨ ivaru ra kʉmooso. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yakakiimana ja ˆvyeene yalʉʉsa, “Avalwa hamwɨ na ˆvawúnaa miiro.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isáaya 53:12</ref>.</char></note>] <verse eid="MRK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Vakeri njɨra vara ˆvalookáa na aho, <char style="w" lemma="Tʉkɨra">vakamʉtʉkɨra</char> no singisya mɨtwe na heenchʉ voosea, “Aaɨ, sɨ ʉjáa ʉsea atɨ ʉtɨɨte ngururu jo girimʉla <char style="w">Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva</char>, maa kei wiimye kwa sikʉ itatʉ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Sabúuri 22:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Hoonɨ haaha kiima aho mʉsaláabii, wiilamurirye!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Viivyo vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva na vakiindya va Miiro vakamʉhenchʉla, voosea, “Avalamuriryáa vɨɨngɨ, amwɨ yoosiindwa kiilamurirya yeemweene? <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Atɨ, yeeye nɨ <char style="w">Masía</char>, mʉtemi wa <char style="w" lemma="Viisiraéeli">Isiraéeli</char>, nɨ akiime sa tʉlaange, de turume.” Baa vara ˆvajáa vaturikiriwa mɨsaláabii ne, vakamʉtʉkɨra.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookwya Mʉsaláabii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matáayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lʉ́ka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yooháani 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Na kwaandɨra mpɨɨndɨ ja mpoloonge fʉʉrʉ mpɨɨndɨ ja cháámuusi, kilwiirya kɨkakʉnɨkɨrɨra ɨsɨ yoosi. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>ˆƗkafike mpɨɨndɨ ja cháámuusi, Yéesu akaanɨrɨra na ngururu, yoolʉʉsɨka na ndʉʉsɨka ya kɨmeevo ya Kɨaráamu, “<char style="it">Elóoi, Elóoi, láama sabakɨtáani?</char>”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 22:1">Sabúuri 22:1</ref>.</char></note> noo kʉsea, “Ee Mʉlʉʉngʉ, ee Mʉlʉʉngʉ, amwɨ waandékire?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Vamwɨ va vaantʉ vara ˆvajáa hara ˆvakateere ayo masáare, maa vakasea, “Teeri, yoomʉkemera <char style="w">Elía</char>.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ akakʉʉrɨka, akafarɨmbɨrɨra kɨɨntʉ ˆkɨrɨ monyomonyo isaangii, akɨɨta tukya diváaii ˆyasasʉka, maa akamʉheera Yéesu afiiye, kʉnʉ yoosea, “Mʉreki, hoonɨ tʉlaange koonɨ Elía arɨ kʉʉja jɨ amukiimye aho mʉsaláabii.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Hara, maa Yéesu akaana na ngururu, akawulala. <verse eid="MRK 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Hahara <char style="w">ipasía ra Kaaya Njija</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Ufumo 26:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 6:19">Vaeburanía 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:19-22">10:19-22</ref>.</char></note> rɨkaatʉka katɨ na katɨ fuma mweeri fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa valwi nkoondo ˆajáa iímire mbere ya mʉsaláaba, ˆakoone ˆvyeene Yéesu awʉ́lɨɨre, maa akasea, “Kɨmaarɨ, ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ nɨ <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> aarɨ.” <figure style="fig" alt="curtain torn from top to bottom" file="CN01843B.TIF" size="col" copy="© 1996 David C. Cook" ref="15:38">Ipasía rookaatʉka fuma mweeri fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Hara kʉlɨ kʉlɨ, kwajáa kwatɨɨte vaantʉ vaki ˆvalaangáa ayo masáare. Aho jei, vajáa vamwaarɨ vala <char style="w">Maríia Makɨdaléena</char>, Salóome na Maríia íyo waala Yóose mwaanaavo na Yaakúupu muduudi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Avo noo ˆvamutuubáa Yéesu mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa <char style="w">Galiláaya</char> noo mʉtʉmamɨra. Baa kei, vajáa vamwaarɨ vaantʉ vaki vɨɨngɨ ˆvarɨ foo, ˆvajáa vʉʉja ne na Yerusaléemu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yootaahwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matáayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lʉ́ka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yooháani 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Sikʉ Yéesu ˆawulala nɨ sikʉ yo virisha <char style="w">Sabáato</char> ɨjáa, sikʉ ɨmwɨ de ɨve Sabáato na kyʉʉlwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Kwajáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Yooséefu fuma múuji wa Arimatáaya. Yooséefu nɨ ʉmwɨ wa Balása Nkʉʉlʉ ya Vayahúudi ajáa. Anyemiwáa maatʉkʉ vii, baa kei, awoojáa kʉʉja kwa <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>. Akiitema, akadoma kwa Piláato, akɨtooloomba aheewe mʉvɨrɨ wa Yéesu sa akʉʉtaahe. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Piláato ˆakapate mʉlomo Yéesu akwíire chaangʉ vii, maa akatʉlʉvala. Akamwaanɨrɨra mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa valwi nkoondo, maa akamuurya koonɨ nɨ kɨmáárɨ Yéesu akwíire. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Piláato ˆakawyɨɨrwe nɨ ʉra mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa valwi nkoondo nɨ kɨmáárɨ Yéesu akwíire, maa akamʉheera rʉ́ʉsa Yooséefu asʉmʉle mʉvɨrɨ wa Yéesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yooséefu akɨɨtowʉla sáanda ya <char style="w">kɨtáani</char>. Akuukiimya mʉvɨrɨ wa Yéesu, akʉʉfarɨmbɨrɨra na ɨra sáanda, maa akɨɨta kʉʉtaaha <char style="w" lemma="Mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra">mbiríírii</char> ya mpaanga ˆngʼeene ɨjáa yabokwa lʉkaandii lwa iwye. Akafingiritya iwye ikʉʉlʉ yoorifintamya mʉryaangwii wa mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Vala Maríia Makɨdaléena na Maríia íyo waala Yóose, vakahoona hara haantʉ Yéesu ˆatáahirwe.<figure style="fig" alt="cave like tomb" file="DN00494b.tif" size="col" copy="United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya" ref="15:46">Mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra ya mpaanga</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Kʉfʉfʉka kwa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matáayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lʉ́ka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yooháani 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Lomʉtóondo yaachwe mwaasʉ ˆʉkakʉtʉmɨre, sikʉ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char> ɨkalooka. Hahara, <char style="w">Maríia Makɨdaléena</char>, Salóome na Maríia íyo waala Yaakúupu vakɨɨta wʉla makuta ˆyanyʉkɨra, sa vakahake mʉvɨrɨ wa <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>ˆKʉkamwaae vii sikʉ ya Jumapɨ́ɨrɨ na mwaasʉ ˆʉkatʉle, vakadoma na <char style="w" lemma="Mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra">mbiríírii</char> ya mpaanga ˆyabokwa mwaalaliwyii haantʉ Yéesu ˆataahɨɨrwé. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa vakaarɨ njirii, vakaanda kiiyurya, “Nɨ ani de arɨ ko tufingiritirya rɨra iwye hara mʉryaangwii wa mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Valʉʉsa jeyyo, sa rɨra iwye nɨ ikʉ́ʉ́lʉ maatʉkʉ vii rɨjáa. ˆVakafike vii, vakoona rɨra iwye rafíngiritiiwe, risiina tʉkʉ hara mʉryaangwii. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>ˆVakɨɨngɨre hara mbiríírii, vakamoona mʉtavana ʉmwɨ iivɨ́kɨɨre nkáancho njerʉ chwee, iíkyɨɨre mʉkono wa kʉlʉme wa mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra, maa vakiivʉndʉka maatʉkʉ vii.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Ʉra mʉtavana akavasea, “Koofi tʉkʉ! Sɨ mʉsaakɨra mwiise Yéesu fuma Nasaréeti ʉra ˆaningʼiniiwé mʉsaláabii fʉʉrʉ akakwya? Afúfukire! Asiina aha tʉkʉ. Laangi baa haantʉ ˆalaariiwé. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Haaha domi kwa vapooji vaachwe baa na <char style="w">Peéteri</char> mʉkavasee, ‘Yéesu valongorera iise na <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>, ʉko moona mʉrɨ ja ˆvyeene ajáa avasea.’”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Maáriki 14:28</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Vara vaantʉ vaki kʉnʉ vootetema nɨ woowa, vakafuma hara mbiríírii itɨ́ɨjo, kʉnʉ vatʉ́lʉvɨɨre. Sɨ valʉʉsa isáare roroosi kwa mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ sa voofáa maatʉkʉ vii.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s2">[Masáare aya 9-20 yasiina nakáalii jɨɨngɨ ja kalɨkaalɨ tʉkʉ.]</para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉfʉmɨra Maríia Makɨdaléena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matáayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yooháani 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Yéesu ˆakafʉfʉke Jumapɨ́ɨrɨ namʉtóondo uchikʉ, mʉʉntʉ wa ncholo ˆamʉfʉmɨra nɨ Maríia Makɨdaléena. Ʉhʉ Maríia, Yéesu ajáa amʉseyya <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char> mufungatɨ. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Maa Maríia akadoma, akavawyɨɨra vara vaantʉ ˆvayeendanʼyáa na Yéesu. Avo vaantʉ vajáa vakaarɨ voorɨra no myaa. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>ˆVakateere Yéesu afúfukire, baa Maríia Makɨdaléena amwɨɨ́ne, sɨ varuma ayo masáare tʉkʉ.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovafʉmɨra Vapooji Vaachwe Vavɨrɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Lʉ́ka 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi ˆɨkalooke, Yéesu akavafʉmɨra vapooji vaachwe vavɨrɨ ˆvadomáa na maturii, arɨ na buuwo ˆyiísimire. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Avo vaantʉ vakahɨndʉka na Yerusaléemu, vakavawyɨɨra viivaavo, baa avo sɨ vavaruma vii tʉkʉ.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovatʉma Vapooji Vaachwe Ikimi na Ʉmwɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matáayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lʉ́ka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yooháani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mɨrɨmo ya Vatumwi 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Lo mwiisho, Yéesu akavafʉmɨra vapooji vaachwe ikimi na ʉmwɨ mpɨɨndɨ ˆvarijáa chákurya. Akavadalavya, sa viintʉ sɨ ˆvavaruma vara ˆveene vajáa vamoona afúfukire na ʉfafu wa mɨtɨma yaavo.<verse eid="MRK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Maa akavasea, “Domi kʉrɨ weerʉ yoosi, mʉkavawyɨɨre no vavariyʉrɨra vaantʉ voosi <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char>. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Ʉra ˆarɨ ruma no <char style="w" lemma="Batisa">batisiwa</char>, hona arɨ. Maa kaa, ˆmweene arɨ siita ruma, heewa arɨ irya nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Na iji noo isháara ˆvarɨ kʉva nojo vara ˆveene varɨ ruma. Kwa irina raanɨ vaseyya varɨ vaantʉ mirimʉ mɨvɨ, kei lʉʉsɨka varɨ ndʉʉsɨka ifya sɨ ˆvanajiteera baa sikʉ ɨmwɨ. <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Baa vakwaate njoka na mɨkono, na vanywe kɨnyéruumbe, sɨ varɨ kʉva kɨɨntʉ vii kaa tʉkʉ. Kei, vavɨkɨra varɨ mɨkono valwɨ́ɨrɨ, novo hongera varɨ.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoosʉmʉlwa na Kurumwii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lʉ́ka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-11">Mɨrɨmo ya Vatumwi 1:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Maa reerʉ, Yéesu Mweenevyoosi ˆakahʉmʉle vawyɨɨra ayo masáare, akasʉmʉlwa na kurumwii. Kʉra mweeri akiikala mʉkono wa kʉlʉme wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="MRK 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Vapooji vaachwe, vakadoma, vakavawyɨɨra no vavariyʉrɨra Masáare Maaja haantʉ hoosi. Yéesu Mweenevyoosi ne akatʉmama novo no roonekya isáare raachwe ko bweeyya isháara ˆjidómanʼyaa na isáare ɨro.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
